#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: scaffoldProject()"
msgstr "# 函数: scaffoldProject()"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scaffold a starter project for a platform, with pantoken already installed and wired in."
msgstr "为某个平台生成一个入门项目模板，已预装并集成 pantoken。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The target directory (default `\".\"`). Its basename (or `\"pantoken-app\"` for `\".\"`)\n  is substituted for `{{projectName}}` in the template files."
msgstr "目标目录（默认 `\".\"`）。其基名（或针对 `\".\"` 使用 `\"pantoken-app\"`）\n  在模板文件中替换为 `{{projectName}}`。"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### options?"
msgstr "### options?"

#: ai/pantoken-ai/src/functions/scaffoldProject.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`theme`/`mode` select which `@pantoken/css` token sheet scaffolded files\n  import (default `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`), applied across every platform. `cdn` selects the CDN\n  provider `canvas-theme-editor`'s `theme.css`/`theme.js` are built for (default jsDelivr);\n  ignored by every other platform."
msgstr "`theme`/`mode` 用于选择要导入哪些由 `@pantoken/css` 令牌表生成的文件\n  （默认 `\"rebrand\"`/`\"light\"`），并在所有平台上应用。`cdn` 选择 CDN\n  提供商 `canvas-theme-editor` 的 `theme.css`/`theme.js` 所针对的构建（默认 jsDelivr）；\n  其他平台将忽略这些文件。"

