#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-banner` · `alpha` — A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "`.instui-banner` · `alpha` — 一个可关闭、带图标的消息面板，用于页面级或上下文内的公告。"

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Size** controls padding and gap: `relaxed` (default) is roomier; `compact` tightens both.\n  **Color** sets the fill: bare (no modifier) is unfilled — border and icon only; `-color-violet`\n  and `-color-sea` add a tinted background plus a matching icon swatch."
msgstr "**Size** 控制内边距和间距：`relaxed`（默认）更宽敞；`compact` 则更紧凑。\n  **Color** 设置填充：bare（无修饰）不填充——仅有边框和图标；`-color-violet`\n  和 `-color-sea` 会添加带色调的背景及相匹配的图标色块。"

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add `role=\"status\"` (or `role=\"alert\"` for urgent messages) so assistive tech announces the\n  banner; mark a decorative icon `aria-hidden=\"true\"` and give the close button an `aria-label`."
msgstr "添加 `role=\"status\"`（对于紧急消息使用 `role=\"alert\"`），以便辅助技术播报横幅；将装饰性图标标记为 `aria-hidden=\"true\"`，并为关闭按钮添加 `aria-label`。"

#: css/banner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@import \"@pantoken/plugin-custom-components/custom-components.css\";"
msgstr "@import \"@pantoken/plugin-custom-components/custom-components.css\";"

