#: css/billboard.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: billboard"
msgstr ""

#: css/billboard.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-billboard` — A large empty-state or call-to-action block: a hero icon or image, a heading, and a message."
msgstr "`.instui-billboard` — 一个大型空状态或号召性用语块：一个主图标或图片、一个标题和一条信息。"

#: css/billboard.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.hero`/`.heading`/`.message` parts are composed by the consumer's markup, not enforced structure; `-clickable` only adds hover styling, so a real click target still needs `tabindex` and a keyboard handler."
msgstr "`.hero`/`.heading`/`.message` 部分由使用者的标记组成，而非强制性的结构；`-clickable` 仅添加悬停样式，因此真实的点击目标仍需要 `tabindex` 和键盘处理器。"

#: css/billboard.md
