#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: button"
msgstr ""

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-button` — An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "`.instui-button` — 一个可访问的操作控件，从令牌调色板中样式化；默认是主要操作。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI variants layer two gradients — a padding-box fill and a border-box stroke — for their frame, and `-color-ai-secondary` can't paint gradient text and a fill at once, so its centre stays transparent at rest and fills on hover or active. `-without-background` hover and active derive a low-opacity, slightly-darkened brand wash rather than using the raw hover-background tokens, which would print same-colour-on-same-colour text. Also sets its own icon/label `gap` and horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. The optional `.instui-button-group` wrapper maps Figma's `.buttonGroup` and owns adjacent button spacing."
msgstr "AI 变体为其框架叠加两层渐变 — 一个 padding-box 填充和一个 border-box 描边，且 `-color-ai-secondary` 无法同时绘制渐变文本和填充，因此在静止时中心保持透明，悬停或激活时才填充。`-without-background` 的悬停和激活状态派生出低不透明度、略微加深的品牌色洗层，而不是使用原始的悬停背景令牌（那样会导致同色背景上的文本无法辨识）。还设置了自身的图标/标签 `gap` 和水平 `padding`；链式应用 `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` 间距工具修饰符会覆盖这些内建值。可选的 `.instui-button-group` 包装器映射 Figma 的 `.buttonGroup` 并管理相邻按钮间距。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [button.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/button/button.css)"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drive the `-toggle` variant's pressed state with `aria-pressed`, and mark a disabled button with `aria-disabled` (or the native `disabled`)."
msgstr "使用 `aria-pressed` 驱动 `-toggle` 变体的按下状态，并用 `aria-disabled`（或原生 `disabled`）标记禁用按钮。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A group wrapper lays out adjacent buttons with the shared button gap."
msgstr "一个分组包装器以共享的按钮间隙布局相邻按钮。"

