msgid "Render a glyph from the icon set before the label (e.g. `-icon-arrow-right`), painted in the button's text colour; pair with `-shape-square`/`-shape-circle` for an icon-only button."
msgstr "在标签前从图标集渲染一个字形（例如 `-icon-arrow-right`），按按钮文本颜色绘制；与 `-shape-square`/`-shape-circle` 配合可用于仅图标按钮。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For a button placed on a coloured (non-neutral) surface. Composed with `-color-primary` (default) fills white with dark text; composed with `-color-secondary` stays transparent with a white border and text."
msgstr "用于放置在有色（非中性）表面上的按钮。与 `-color-primary` 组合（默认）会填充白色并使用深色文本；与 `-color-secondary` 组合则保持透明并使用白色边框和文本。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A round icon button."
msgstr "圆形图标按钮。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A square icon button."
msgstr "方形图标按钮。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) medium size."
msgstr "（默认）中等尺寸。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) medium size. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "（默认）中等尺寸。是 `-size-md` 的长形式别名。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A pressed-state toggle button (drive with aria-pressed)."
msgstr "按下态切换按钮（使用 aria-pressed 驱动）。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drop the fill (ghost)."
msgstr "去除填充（幽灵）。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove the border."
msgstr "移除边框。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI-secondary gradient border ring, masked to just the button's frame."
msgstr "AI 次要渐变边框环，仅遮罩到按钮的框架部分。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The AI glyph, added automatically to AI buttons and masked in the variant's own colour."
msgstr "AI 字形，自动添加到 AI 按钮并使用该变体自身的颜色进行遮罩。"

#: css/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [close-button](/api/css/close-button.md) — The icon-only dismiss button."
msgstr "- [close-button](/api/css/close-button.md) — 仅图标的关闭按钮。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: byline"
msgstr ""

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-byline` — A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "`.instui-byline` — 一个媒体对象：在标题和描述旁边的主图像。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the figure and the text block; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在图像与文本块之间设置其自己的 `gap`；链接一个 `-gap-*` 间距工具修饰符将覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [byline.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/byline/byline.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [byline.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/byline/byline.css)"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Vertically centre the text beside the hero."
msgstr "将主图像旁的文本在垂直方向居中。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align the text to the top of the hero."
msgstr "将文本与主图像顶部对齐。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a leading glyph icon before the text block."
msgstr "在文本块前渲染一个前导字形图标。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium."
msgstr "中等。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "中等。`-size-md` 的长形式别名。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The supporting body text."
msgstr "辅助正文文本。"

#: css/byline.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The heading text."
msgstr "标题文本。"

