msgstr "来自相邻月份的一天（前导/尾随填充）。"

#: css/calendar.day.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The selected date."
msgstr "所选日期。"

#: css/calendar.day.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Today's date."
msgstr "今天的日期。"

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: calendar"
msgstr ""

#: css/calendar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-calendar` — A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "`.instui-calendar` — 带有导航、星期表头和日期单元的静态月份网格。"

#: css/calendar.md
