msgid "cursor: wait."
msgstr "cursor: wait."

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"
msgstr "# CSS: drawer-layout.content"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.content` — The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "`.content` — 填充托盘旁剩余空间的主要内容面板。"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Once the parent's inline-size drops below `46em` (`16em` tray width + `30em` breakpoint), a `@container` query on the parent's `pantoken-drawer-layout` container drops this member's `min-inline-size` to `0` automatically, matching the manual `[should-overlay-tray]` override."
msgstr "一旦父元素的 inline-size 小于 `46em`（`16em` 托盘宽度 + `30em` 断点），对父元素的 `pantoken-drawer-layout` 容器的 `@container` 查询会自动将该成员的 `min-inline-size` 降为 `0`，以匹配手动的 `[should-overlay-tray]` 覆盖。"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Carry `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "保留 `role=\"region\"`（InstUI 的 DrawerLayout 约定），当仅凭上下文无法识别时，使用 `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` 为其命名。"

#: css/drawer-layout.content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.tray](/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.tray](/zh-Hans/api/css/drawer-layout.tray.md) — The adjacent panel in the same flex row."

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-drawer-layout` — A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "`.instui-drawer-layout` — 一个带可折叠侧托盘和主滚动内容面板的分割布局。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-placement-end` and the default (start) both use `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` logical properties, not `left`/`right`, so the tray's side follows `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` automatically — no separate RTL rules are needed."
msgstr "`-placement-end` 和默认（start）都使用 `flex-direction`/`inset-inline-*` 逻辑属性，而不是 `left`/`right`，因此托盘的侧位会自动遵循 `direction`/`dir=\"rtl\"` — 无需单独的 RTL 规则。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [drawer-layout.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/drawer-layout/drawer-layout.css)"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "When the tray acts as navigation, label it with an accessible heading or `aria-label`. Give `.content` `role=\"region\"` (InstUI's DrawerLayout convention) and name it with `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` when context alone doesn't identify it."
msgstr "当托盘用作导航时，应以可访问的标题或 `aria-label` 标注。为 `.content` 提供 `role=\"region\"`（InstUI 的 DrawerLayout 约定），并在上下文本身不能识别时，用 `aria-label`/`aria-labelledby` 为其命名。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Show the tray even when the `open` attribute is absent."
msgstr "即使缺少 `open` 属性也要显示托盘。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-end side."
msgstr "将托盘停靠在内联结束侧。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock the tray on the inline-start side (the default; sets it explicitly)."
msgstr "将托盘停靠在内联起始侧（默认；显式设置）。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Render the tray as an overlay instead of shrinking content inline."
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The main pane."
msgstr "主面板。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel."
msgstr "侧面板。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Width threshold for overlay mode (`30em`, themed via responsive utilities)."
msgstr "覆盖模式的宽度阈值（`30em`，通过响应式实用工具进行主题化）。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` members switch to overlay mode automatically via a `@container` query once this element's inline-size drops below tray-width + `--pantoken-bp-md`. The `@pantoken/interactions` behavior additionally toggles `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray` (a manual override) and emits `overlaytraychange` for apps that need the change as an event."
msgstr "- 当此元素的内联尺寸小于托盘宽度 + `--pantoken-bp-md` 时，`drawer-layout.tray`/`drawer-layout.content` 成员会通过 `@container` 查询自动切换到覆盖模式。`@pantoken/interactions` 行为还会切换 `[should-overlay-tray]`/`.-should-overlay-tray`（一个手动覆盖），并为需要以事件感知更改的应用发出 `overlaytraychange`。"

#: css/drawer-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A standalone edge overlay; this layout keeps tray and content in the same flow.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A smaller anchored surface for contextual actions and detail."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — 独立的边缘覆盖；此布局将托盘和内容保持在同一文档流中。\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — 一个更小的锚定面，用于上下文操作与详情。"

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: drawer-layout.tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tray` — The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "`.tray` — 主内容旁的侧边面板，具有可选的覆盖模式和托盘式表面修饰符。"

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Positioning uses `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline` (never `left`/`right`), so `-placement-end` docks to the true trailing edge in both LTR and RTL."
msgstr "定位使用 `inset-inline-start`/`inset-inline`（从不使用 `left`/`right`），因此 `-placement-end` 在 LTR 和 RTL 中都贴靠真实的尾部边缘。"

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "If used as navigation, wrap links in a semantic `<nav>` and provide an accessible name."
msgstr "如果用作导航，请将链接包裹在语义化的 `<nav>` 中并提供可访问名称。"

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dock this tray to inline-end when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "在覆盖模式激活时，将此托盘停靠到 inline-end。"

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove the panel edge border."
msgstr "移除面板边缘边框。"

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Remove elevation when overlay mode is active."
msgstr "在覆盖模式激活时移除 elevation。"

#: css/drawer-layout.tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — The primary pane that flexes alongside this member."
msgstr "- [drawer-layout.content](/api/css/drawer-layout.content.md) — 与该成员并列伸缩的主窗格。"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: file-drop"
msgstr ""

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-file-drop` — A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "`.instui-file-drop` — 一个具有悬停、接受和拒绝状态的文件放置区。"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` classes are purely visual — actual drag-and-drop detection and file validation are the consumer's JS to wire up around the wrapped native input."
msgstr "这些 `-hover`/`-accepted`/`-rejected` 类仅用于视觉呈现 — 实际的拖放检测和文件校验由使用者的 JS 在包装的原生输入周围实现。"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [file-drop.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/file-drop/file-drop.css)"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap a native `<input type=\"file\">` in the `<label>` drop zone so it stays a real, labelled file control that the keyboard and assistive tech can operate."
msgstr "在 `<label>` 放置区中包裹原生的 `<input type=\"file\">`，使其保持为真实的、有标签的文件控件，便于键盘和辅助技术操作。"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for an acceptable file."
msgstr "表示可接受文件的拖动状态。"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hover or drag-over state."
msgstr "悬停或拖入状态。"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render the leading dropzone glyph icon."
msgstr "渲染前导的放置区图标。"

#: css/file-drop.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Drag state for a rejected file."
msgstr "表示被拒绝文件的拖动状态。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-group` — A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-group` — 一个带有图例、列或内联布局且间距可配置的 `<fieldset>` 组。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between fields, tunable with the `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` modifiers below — prefer those over chaining a generic `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier, which overrides the built-in value outright."
msgstr "在字段之间设置其自身的 `gap`，可通过下面的 `-col-spacing-*`/`-row-spacing-*` 修饰符调节 — 优先使用这些，而不是链式使用通用的 `-gap-*` 间距实用修饰符（后者会直接覆盖内置值）。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-group/form-field-group.css)"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>`, so the legend text names the whole group for assistive tech."
msgstr "呈现一个原生的 `<fieldset>` 并带有 `<legend>`，因此图例文本可为辅助技术命名整个组。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large column gap."
msgstr "较大的列间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium column gap."
msgstr "中等列间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No column gap."
msgstr "无列间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small column gap."
msgstr "较小的列间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Align child fields to a shared grid."
msgstr "将子字段对齐到共享网格。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields out in columns."
msgstr "以多列方式布局子字段。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay child fields inline, in a row."
msgstr "将子字段以内联方式在一行中排列。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the group as required."
msgstr "将该组标记为必填。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large row gap."
msgstr "较大的行间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium row gap."
msgstr "中等行间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "No row gap."
msgstr "无行间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small row gap."
msgstr "较小的行间距。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the fields."
msgstr "字段底部对齐。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Middle-align the fields."
msgstr "字段垂直居中对齐。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the fields."
msgstr "字段顶部对齐。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the legend text when the group is required."
msgstr "当组为必填时，在图例文本之后渲染装饰性必填字段星号。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- The `-layout-aligned` mode uses CSS subgrid behind an `@supports` guard; where subgrid is unsupported, the fields fall back to their own stacked layout."
msgstr "- `-layout-aligned` 模式在 `@supports` 保护下使用 CSS 子网格；若子网格不受支持，字段将退回到各自的堆叠布局。"

#: css/form-field-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — The single field this group repeats.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Groups radio inputs under a legend."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — 该组重复的单个字段。\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — 在图例下对单选输入进行分组。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field-messages"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field-messages` — Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field-messages` — 字段帮助和验证消息 — 提示、错误、成功，以及仅供屏幕阅读器使用 — 错误和成功时带有图标。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between stacked messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在堆叠消息之间设置自身的 `gap`；链接 `-gap-*` 间距工具修饰符可覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field-messages.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field-messages/form-field-messages.css)"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `-type-screenreader-only` message is visually hidden but stays in the accessibility tree, so it's still announced; pair error and success messages with the field via aria-describedby so assistive tech reads them with the control."
msgstr "`-type-screenreader-only` 消息在视觉上被隐藏但仍保留在无障碍树中，因此仍会被宣读；通过 aria-describedby 将错误和成功消息与字段配对，以便辅助技术在读取控件时一并读取这些消息。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-type-error`."
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An individual message; its `-type-*` picks the hint, error, success, or screen-reader-only variant."
msgstr "单条消息；其 `-type-*` 可选择提示、错误、成功或仅屏幕阅读器变体。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the leading status glyph on error and success messages: an alert circle for errors and a check circle for success."
msgstr "在错误和成功消息上呈现前导状态图标：错误为警示圆圈，成功为勾选圆圈。"

#: css/form-field-messages.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — Wraps a label, controls, and these messages."
msgstr "- [form-field](/api/css/form-field.md) — 包裹标签、控件和这些消息。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: form-field"
msgstr ""

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-form-field` — A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-form-field` — 表单字段包装器：一个标签、其控件，以及行内、必填或只读布局。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An error message stays hidden until the field's control is `:user-invalid` (after the user interacts) or you add the `-invalid` class. Use `-layout-inline` to put the label beside the controls and `-layout-stacked` to put it above. Also sets its own `gap` between the label, controls, and messages; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "错误信息在字段的控件未 `:user-invalid`（用户交互后）或未添加 `-invalid` 类之前保持隐藏。使用 `-layout-inline` 将标签放在控件旁边，使用 `-layout-stacked` 将其放在上方。还会在标签、控件和消息之间设置自己的 `gap`；链接一个 `-gap-*` 间距实用修饰符会覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [form-field.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/form-field/form-field.css)"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `<label>` element wraps the control, so the label text names it natively; the required asterisk is decorative and should be hidden from assistive tech (aria-hidden), and the error message surfaces once the control is `:user-invalid` or you add the `-invalid` class."
msgstr "`<label>` 元素包裹控件，因此标签文本对其具有原生命名；必填星号为装饰性，应对辅助技术隐藏（aria-hidden），错误信息在控件 `:user-invalid` 或添加 `-invalid` 类时显示。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout (shorthand for `-layout-inline`)."
msgstr "行内布局（`-layout-inline` 的简写）。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the label text."
msgstr "将标签文本右对齐（末端对齐）。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the label text."
msgstr "将标签文本左对齐（起始对齐）。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline layout: label beside the controls."
msgstr "行内布局：标签放在控件旁边。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stacked layout: label above the controls."
msgstr "堆叠布局：标签位于控件上方。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "将标签与控件底部对齐。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top-align the label with the controls."
msgstr "将标签与控件顶部对齐。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control area beside or below the label."
msgstr "标签旁边或下方的控件区域。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The field label."
msgstr "字段标签。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the decorative required-field asterisk after the label text when the field is required."
msgstr "当字段为必填时，在标签文本后渲染装饰性必填星号。"

#: css/form-field.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — Renders the field's hint, error, and success messages.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — Groups related fields under a shared legend."
msgstr "- [form-field-messages](/api/css/form-field-messages.md) — 渲染字段的提示、错误和成功消息。\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — 将相关字段分组到共享的图例下。"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: gap"
msgstr ""

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--gap-md` — Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "`.--gap-md` — 在间距刻度上的 Flex/grid `gap` 实用工具，短写（`--gap-sm`）或长写（`--gap-small`）。可单独使用或链式附加到任何组件（`.instui-view.--gap-sm`）——已经从组件特定令牌设置其自身 `gap` 的组件可能会被覆盖。"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/gap/index.ts)"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies the medium spacing token as the gap."
msgstr "将中等间距令牌用作间隙。"

#: css/gap.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Gap utilities across short and long spacing-step spellings."
msgstr "跨短写与长写间距步长的间隙实用工具。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: heading"
msgstr ""

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-heading` — Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "`.instui-heading` — 从 `-level-h1` 到 `-level-h6` 的标题排版。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `-variant-*` presets override a `-level-*`'s font-size and font-weight, so combine only one of each family per element."
msgstr "`-variant-*` 预设会覆盖 `-level-*` 的字体大小和字重，因此每个元素只应组合每个家族的一种。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [heading.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/heading/heading.css)"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "These classes set the visual level only, so render a real `<h1>`–`<h6>` (or use `role=\"heading\"` with `aria-level`) to convey the heading level."
msgstr "这些类仅设置视觉层级，因此应渲染真实的 `<h1>`–`<h6>`（或在配合 `aria-level` 时使用 `role=\"heading\"`）来传达标题等级。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a bottom rule."
msgstr "添加底部分隔线。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Add a top rule."
msgstr "添加顶部分隔线。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "AI-accent colour."
msgstr "AI 强调色。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Primary colour."
msgstr "（默认）主色。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark (primary inverse) colour."
msgstr "深色背景上（主色反色）。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary (muted) colour."
msgstr "次要（弱化）颜色。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h1 type scale."
msgstr "按 h1 字体尺度渲染。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h2 type scale."
msgstr "按 h2 字体尺度渲染。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h3 type scale."
msgstr "按 h3 字体尺度渲染。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h4 type scale."
msgstr "按 h4 字体尺度渲染。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h5 type scale."
msgstr "按 h5 字体尺度渲染。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render at the h6 type scale."
msgstr "按 h6 字体尺度渲染。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label type preset."
msgstr "标签文字预设。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mini card-title preset."
msgstr "迷你卡片标题预设。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Regular card-title preset."
msgstr "常规卡片标题预设。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Card section-title preset."
msgstr "卡片章节标题预设。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page-title preset."
msgstr "页面标题预设。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Section-title preset."
msgstr "章节标题预设。"

#: css/heading.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography for non-heading text."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — 用于非标题文本的正文字体。"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: hero"
msgstr ""

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-hero\"]` — 带标题、副标题和可选背景图片的全宽页眉区域。"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Hero when:"
msgstr "✅ 在以下情况下使用 Hero："

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a prominent page header with visual hierarchy\n- The page benefits from a large, eye-catching opening section\n- You want to include background imagery or gradient accents\n🚫 Don't use Hero when:"
msgstr "- 需要具有视觉层次感的醒目页面页眉\n- 页面从大型、吸引眼球的开场区域中受益\n- 想要包含背景图像或渐变装饰\n🚫 在以下情况下不要使用 Hero："

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a simple page header — use Page-Layout instead\n- The hero competes with critical content — prioritize readability"
msgstr "- 构建简单页面页眉时 — 请改用 Page-Layout\n- Hero 与关键内容发生竞争时 — 优先保证可读性"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure the title is in an `<h1>` tag for semantic structure\n- If using background images, provide sufficient color contrast for text\n- Avoid autoplay on video or animation that could distract from content"
msgstr "- 确保标题使用 `<h1>` 标签以保持语义结构\n- 使用背景图片时，为文本提供足够的颜色对比度\n- 避免自动播放的视频或动画分散对内容的注意力"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero subtitle content"
msgstr "Hero 子标题内容"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Hero title content"
msgstr "Hero 标题内容"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional action buttons or links."
msgstr "可选的操作按钮或链接。"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional background layer (image or gradient)."
msgstr "可选的背景层（图片或渐变）。"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for hero text and actions."
msgstr "用于放置 hero 文本和操作的容器。"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional semi-transparent overlay for text contrast."
msgstr "用于提升文本对比度的可选半透明叠加层。"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional supporting text or description."
msgstr "可选的辅助文本或描述。"

#: css/hero.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main hero title (typically `<h1>`)."
msgstr "主 Hero 标题（通常为 `<h1>`）。"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: icon"
msgstr ""

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-icon` — The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "`.instui-icon` — 图标系统：`.instui-icon` 尺寸，以及共享的 `-icon-<name>` 绘制器，该绘制器在任何元素之前对字形（位于 `currentColor` 中）进行遮罩。"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [icon.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/icon/icon.css)"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph is decorative, so mark it `aria-hidden=\"true\"`; give it a `role` or label only when the icon conveys meaning on its own."
msgstr "该字形为装饰性，因此将其标记为 `aria-hidden=\"true\"`；仅当图标本身传达含义时，才为其提供 `role` 或标签。"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Set the glyph token (`--pantoken-glyph`) and render it via the shared painter (for example `-icon-search`)."
msgstr "设置字形令牌（`--pantoken-glyph`），并通过共享的绘制器渲染它（例如 `-icon-search`）。"

#: css/icon.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The glyph itself: a 1em box masked from `--pantoken-glyph` and filled with `currentColor`."
msgstr "字形本身：一个 1em 的方框，从 `--pantoken-glyph` 遮罩并由 `currentColor` 填充。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: img"
msgstr ""

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-img` — A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "`.instui-img` — 带有可叠加的显示、裁剪和效果修饰符的样式化 `<img>`。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Effects compose through the shared `--pantoken-img-filter` custom property, so `-with-grayscale` and `-with-blur` can apply together; the `-constrain-*` crop modifiers require the consumer to size the box explicitly."
msgstr "效果通过共享的 `--pantoken-img-filter` 自定义属性合成，因此 `-with-grayscale` 和 `-with-blur` 可以同时应用；`-constrain-*` 裁剪修饰符要求使用者明确设置容器尺寸。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [img.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/img/img.css)"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Provide meaningful `alt` text that describes the image, and use an empty `alt=\"\"` for purely decorative images so assistive tech skips them."
msgstr "为 `alt` 提供描述图像的有意义文本；对于纯装饰性图像使用空的 `alt=\"\"`，以便辅助技术跳过它们。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fit within the box (contain)."
msgstr "按比例缩放以适应容器（contain）。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Scale to fill the box (cover)."
msgstr "按比例缩放以填满容器（cover）。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display as a block element."
msgstr "作为块级元素显示。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a blur effect."
msgstr "应用模糊效果。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Apply a grayscale effect."
msgstr "应用灰度效果。"

#: css/img.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — The composed CSS filter on the image; the effect modifiers set it, and you can override it for a custom filter."
msgstr "filter &lt;filter-value-list&gt; \\| none — 图像上合成的 CSS 过滤器；效果修饰符会设置它，您可以覆盖该值以使用自定义过滤器。"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: in-place-edit"
msgstr ""

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-in-place-edit` — A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "`.instui-in-place-edit` — 一个 [contenteditable]，在未聚焦时以文本形式呈现，聚焦后显示输入框样式。"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The input chrome only appears while focused; `-readonly` suppresses both the hover and focus affordances so the element always reads as plain inline text."
msgstr "输入框样式仅在聚焦时出现；`-readonly` 会同时抑制悬停和聚焦提示，使该元素始终呈现为普通内联文本。"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [in-place-edit.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/in-place-edit/in-place-edit.css)"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the editable element `role=\"textbox\"` and an accessible name (`aria-label`)."
msgstr "为可编辑元素提供 `role=\"textbox\"` 和可访问名称（`aria-label`）。"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Shown inline but not editable (no hover/focus affordance)."
msgstr "以内联方式显示但不可编辑（无悬停/聚焦提示）。"

#: css/in-place-edit.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — On focus it shows the same input chrome as a text input."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — 聚焦时显示与文本输入相同的输入框样式。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS API reference"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The CSS API reference covers pantoken's class-based component layer: components, utilities, global rules, and declarations built on the token system."
msgstr "CSS API 参考覆盖 pantoken 的基于类的组件层：构建在代币系统之上的组件、工具类、全局规则和声明。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Components"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Class"
msgstr "类"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "Summary"
msgstr "摘要"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container for AI agents."
msgstr "用于 AI 代理的表面容器。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline message with a status colour bar and a masked status glyph from the shared icon set."
msgstr "带有状态彩色条和来自共享图标集的掩码状态图形的内联消息。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A user avatar showing initials or an image, circular by default."
msgstr "显示首字母或图像的用户头像，默认为圆形。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A small count or status dot placed over a target's corner."
msgstr "放置在目标角落上的小计数或状态点。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dismissible, iconed message surface for page-level or in-context announcements."
msgstr "可关闭的、有图标的消息表面，用于页面级或上下文内的公告。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A large empty-state or call-to-action block: a hero icon or image, a heading, and a message."
msgstr "大型空状态或号召性用块：主图标或图像、标题和消息。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A breadcrumb trail with separators; the last crumb is the current page."
msgstr "带分隔符的面包屑路径；最后一个面包屑为当前页面。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A crumb (InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`), an `<li>` in the parent's `<ol>`; the last one is the current page."
msgstr "一个面包屑（InstUI `Breadcrumb.Link`），父项的 `<ol>` 中的 `<li>`；最后一个是当前页面。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An accessible action control, styled from the token palette; primary by default."
msgstr "可访问的操作控件，使用代币调色板样式；默认为主要样式。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A media object: a hero figure beside a title and description."
msgstr "媒体对象：标题和描述旁的主图像。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A static month grid with navigation, weekday headers, and day cells."
msgstr "带导航、星期标题和日期单元的静态月份网格。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A day cell (InstUI `Calendar.Day`); `-today`, `-selected`, and `-outside-month` mark its state."
msgstr "一个日期单元（InstUI `Calendar.Day`）；`-today`, `-selected` 和 `-outside-month` 标记其状态。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A surface container that accepts arbitrary content."
msgstr "接受任意内容的表面容器。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native checkbox and its label, or a switch via `-variant-toggle`."
msgstr "原生复选框及其标签，或通过 `-variant-toggle` 切换为开关。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A transparent icon button that draws its own × glyph, in three sizes plus an on-color variant."
msgstr "透明图标按钮，自绘 × 符号，提供三种尺寸及一种带色背景的变体。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated callout with a caret, positionable on any side; works as a native `[popover]`."
msgstr "带有尖角且可定位在任一侧的提升提示；可作为原生 `[popover]` 使用。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A split layout with a collapsible side tray and a primary scrollable content pane."
msgstr "带可折叠侧盘和主可滚动内容窗格的分割布局。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The primary content pane that fills remaining space beside the tray."
msgstr "填充侧盘旁剩余空间的主内容窗格。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The side panel beside main content, with optional overlay and tray-like surface modifiers."
msgstr "主内容旁的侧面板，带可选覆盖和托盘式表面修饰符。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A file dropzone with hover, accepted, and rejected states."
msgstr "具有悬停、接受和拒绝状态的文件拖放区。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A form-field wrapper: a label, its controls, and inline, required, or readonly layouts."
msgstr "表单字段包装器：标签、其控件以及内联、必填或只读布局。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A `<fieldset>` group with a legend, a column or inline layout, and configurable spacing."
msgstr "带标题的 `<fieldset>` 组，提供列或内联布局和可配置间距。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Field help and validation messages — hint, error, success, and screen-reader-only — with a glyph on error and success."
msgstr "字段帮助和校验消息 — 提示、错误、成功和仅供屏幕阅读器使用；错误和成功带图标。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Heading typography from `-level-h1` to `-level-h6`."
msgstr "标题排版，从 `-level-h1` 到 `-level-h6`。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled `<img>` with display, crop, and effect modifiers that stack."
msgstr "带有显示、裁剪和效果修饰符并可堆叠的样式化 `<img>`。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [contenteditable] that reads as text until focused, then shows input chrome."
msgstr "一个 [contenteditable]，在获得焦点前以文本形式呈现，获焦后显示输入外壳。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "围绕文本输入的外观封装，带有前导和尾随图标插槽。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "带有尺寸、用于深色背景的反色变体，以及内联或无样式形式的样式化超链接。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "具有代币驱动条目间距的列表。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "列表项（InstUI `List.Item`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "填满其定位父元素并居中内容的内流覆盖——例如卡片上的加载指示器。对于模态，优先使用原生 `<dialog>`（其 `::backdrop` 是遮罩）。这些修饰符的每一种也可全局使用（裸用或链式附加到任意组件）——参见 `mask` 全局工具。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "包含条目、组和分隔符的下拉表面。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "带标签的组标题（InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "菜单项（InstUI `Menu.Item`）；可添加 -disabled、-highlighted 或 -active/[aria-checked]。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "条目之间的分割线（InstUI `Menu.Separator`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "带标签的统计信息 — 大数值上方的说明文字。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "对话框表面（可在原生 &lt;dialog&gt; 上工作）；包含头部/主体/页脚部分。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "内容区域（InstUI `Modal.Body`）；孤立的 `<img>` 可全幅延伸。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "操作行（InstUI `Modal.Footer`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "标题行（InstUI `Modal.Header`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "带有 +/- 微调列的数字输入外观。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "分页导航：编号页、第一页、上一页、下一页和最后一页箭头，以及表示间隙的省略号。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A page link or button (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); the current page carries `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "页面链接或按钮（InstUI `Pagination.Page`）；当前页面带有 `[aria-current]`。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "紧凑的状态标签；可使用共享的 `-icon-<name>` 形式添加前导图标。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "用于原生 `[popover]` 的提升表面，使用 CSS 锚点定位。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "带彩色进度计、尺寸和可选数值标签的确定性进度条。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A circular progress ring driven by `--value` and `--value-max` custom properties."
msgstr "由 `--value` 和 `--value-max` 自定义属性驱动的圆形进度环。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "原生单选按钮及其标签。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "单选组 `<fieldset>`，可为普通形式或连接的分段切换样式。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "带样式的范围滑块，带有反色数值气泡。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "带有填充和空心图形以及可选数字标签的星级评分。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "一列图标在标签上方的垂直导航栏，带有最小化的仅图标模式。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "一个导航条目（InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`）；使用 `-selected` 标记激活项。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "带有下拉箭头的本机样式化 `<select>`，匹配文本输入的状态和尺寸。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "一个动画加载环；请为其提供 role=\"status\" 和 aria-label。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "用于 `th` 与 `td` 的样式化数据表，并可选带标题，支持悬停、固定和堆栈卡片布局。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "表的数据行组（InstUI `Table.Body`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "数据单元格（InstUI `Table.Cell`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "列头单元格（InstUI `Table.ColHeader`）；默认的 `th` 样式会被用于 `th[scope=\"row\"]` 的 `table.row-header` 覆盖。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "表的头部行组（InstUI `Table.Head`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "一行表格（InstUI `Table.Row`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "行头单元格（InstUI `Table.RowHeader`）；样式来自行头令牌，而非列头令牌。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "标签面板集合：标签列表、可选标签及其面板。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "标签的内容面板（InstUI `Tabs.Panel`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "单个标签按钮（InstUI `Tabs.Tab`，由父级 `Tabs` 的标签列表配置）；使用 `-selected` 标记激活项。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "用于关键字或筛选的内联芯片。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Body-text typography with size, weight, colour, and style modifiers."
msgstr "正文文本排版，带有尺寸、字重、颜色和样式修饰符。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled, resizable native `<textarea>` with the same states and sizes as the text input."
msgstr "样式化且可调整大小的本机 `<textarea>`，具有与文本输入相同的状态和尺寸。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<input>` — including `date`, `time`, and `datetime-local`, where the browser supplies the picker — with validation states and sizes."
msgstr "样式化的本机 `<input>` —— 包括 `date`, `time` 和 `datetime-local`，由浏览器提供选择器 —— 带有验证状态和尺寸。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "带有旋转箭头的样式化本机 `<details>` 折叠控件。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "基于 `<details>` 的有边框折叠控件：带箭头的摘要行和可折叠内容。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "一个可定位在任意一侧的 CSS 悬停与焦点提示气泡。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "从任意一侧滑入的边缘固定面板；一个本机 `[popover]` 或 `<dialog>`。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "带有旋转箭头的嵌套集合与叶项的折叠树结构。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The View primitive: a neutral box with key-value modifiers for background, border, radius, shadow, display, position, overflow, and cursor. Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` utilities."
msgstr "View 原语：一个中性盒子，具有用于背景、边框、圆角、阴影、显示、定位、溢出和光标的键值修饰符。这些修饰符中的每一个也可全局使用（裸用或链式附加到任何其他组件）——参见 `background`/`border`/`shadow`/`display`/`position`/`overflow`/`cursor` 工具。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Utilities"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "语义颜色工具：`.--bg-<name>`、`.--text-<name>`（别名为 `.--color-<name>`）和 `.--border-<name>`，用于策划的语义调色板。每个也都有组件附加的别名修饰符（例如在任何 `.instui-<component>` 上使用的 `-bg-danger`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`cursor` as a composable, global class — `.--cursor-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`)."
msgstr "`cursor` 作为可组合的全局类 — `.--cursor-<value>` — 可裸用或链式附加到任何组件（`.instui-button.--cursor-pointer`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flex/grid `gap` utilities on the spacing scale, short (`--gap-sm`) or long (`--gap-small`) spelling. Usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-view.--gap-sm`) — components that already set their own `gap` from a component-specific token may have it overridden."
msgstr "基于间距刻度的 Flex/网格 `gap` 工具，短写（`--gap-sm`）或长写（`--gap-small`）。可裸用或链式附加到任何组件（`.instui-view.--gap-sm`）——已经由组件特定令牌设置其自身 `gap` 的组件可能会被覆盖。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The icon system: `.instui-icon` sizing plus the shared `-icon-<name>` painter that masks a glyph (in `currentColor`) before any element."
msgstr "图标系统：`.instui-icon` 尺寸以及在任何元素之前用作遮罩图形的共享 `-icon-<name>` 绘制器（位于 `currentColor` 中）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "显示与文本对齐工具 — `.--display-<value>` 与 `.--text-align-<value>` — 作为可组合的全局类，可裸用或链式附加到任何组件。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "`mask` 组件覆盖修饰符的全局双份副本 — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — 可裸用或链式附加到任何组件，无需包裹在 `.instui-mask` 元素中。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`overflow-x`/`overflow-y` 作为可组合的全局类 — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — 可裸用或链式附加到任何组件。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`position` as a composable, global class — `.--position-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."
msgstr "`position` 作为可组合的全局类 — `.--position-<value>` — 可裸用或链式附加到任何组件（`.instui-button.--position-relative`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "基于主题断点刻度的视窗或容器宽度显示/隐藏类。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "视觉上隐藏内容同时保持其对辅助技术可用（标准裁剪模式）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "外边距和内边距工具 —— `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` 和 `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>`，基于间距刻度（边侧 `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` 或无，支持短写或完整写法 —— 例如 `--mb-sm` 与 `--margin-bottom-small` 是相同规则；margin 还接受 `auto`）。可单独使用或链式添加到任意组件（例如 `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "z-index 深度工具 —— `.--stack-<level>`（`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`）—— 可单独使用或链式添加到任意组件，使图层按可预测方式堆叠，而不是手动调整数字。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "用于 `Transition` 组件的动画状态类 —— `.instui-transition` 与状态类（`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, 等）—— 可单独使用或链式添加到任意组件。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "带有行数限制的省略号截断，由 `--lines` 控制 —— 可单独使用或链式添加到任意组件（`.instui-button.--truncate`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "布局调试轮廓：将复合 `.-with-visual-debug` 添加到任意元素以描绘该盒子及其直接子元素，便于一目了然地查看布局结构。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Rules"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opt-in global reset: `box-sizing`, the page surface, base text colour and font, `color-scheme`, and link defaults."
msgstr "可选的全局重置：`box-sizing`、页面表面、基础文本颜色和字体、`color-scheme` 以及链接默认样式。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "用于原生 HTML 的排版默认值 —— 标题、段落、列表、链接和代码 —— 在导入处自动应用（默认 `:where(body)`）；传入 `options.scope` 可定位到不同的内容根（例如 `.vp-doc`）。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## Plugins"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Instructure product logos as CSS image tokens: `--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` holds a data-URI SVG, so a logo paints via e.g. `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)`."
msgstr "Instructure 产品徽标作为 CSS 图像 token：`--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` 包含 data-URI SVG，因此徽标可通过例如 `background-image: var(--instui-logo-canvas-horizontal-color)` 呈现。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw primitive palette: `.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` paint a colour from the primitive colour tokens, plus `font-family`/`font-weight` utilities for the primitive font tokens. Kept out of the semantic utilities so overrides there stay semantic-only."
msgstr "原始基础色板的可选工具类：`.instui-bg-`/`fg-`/`border-primitive-color-<name>` 可使用基础颜色 token 上色，另外有 `font-family`/`font-weight` 用于基础字体 token。为了保持语义工具的纯粹覆盖，这些类被排除在语义工具之外。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "## layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline information alert for a short reminder or note."
msgstr "用于简短提醒或注释的内联信息提示。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Full-width header section with title, subtitle, and optional background image."
msgstr "全宽页眉区，包含标题、副标题和可选背景图片。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "标准三栏页面布局，包含页眉、侧边栏和主内容区域。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "带有评分类别和评分指示器的结构化笔记。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Quote or testimonial display with attribution and optional imagery."
msgstr "带有署名和可选图像的引用或推荐展示。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "左右两栏布局，包含左侧和右侧内容区域。"

#: css/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "应用外壳行：侧边导航、带页眉的容器，以及可选面板。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-input-group` — A facade around a text input with leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "`.instui-input-group` — 在文本输入外层的外观封装，带有前置和后置图标插槽。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps the same field chrome as `text-input` with icon slots either side of it; `-should-not-wrap` is only needed when the group's contents would otherwise overflow onto a second line."
msgstr "封装与 `text-input` 相同的字段样式，在其两侧提供图标插槽；仅当组内内容会溢出到第二行时才需要 `-should-not-wrap`。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/input-group/input-group.css)"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Disabled state."
msgstr "禁用状态。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the group on one line (no wrapping)."
msgstr "将组保持在单行（不换行）。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success (valid) state."
msgstr "成功（有效）状态。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The trailing content slot."
msgstr "后置内容插槽。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The leading content slot."
msgstr "前置内容插槽。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text of the inner input, in a muted color."
msgstr "内部输入框的占位文本，使用弱化颜色。"

#: css/input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Wraps a text input, adding leading and trailing icon slots."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — 包裹文本输入，添加前置和后置图标插槽。"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--display-flex` — Display and text-align utilities — `.--display-<value>` and `.--text-align-<value>` — as composable, global classes, usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--display-flex` — 显示与文本对齐工具 — `.--display-<value>` 和 `.--text-align-<value>` — 作为可组合的全局类，可单独使用或链接到任何组件上。"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/layout/index.ts)"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets `display: flex`."
msgstr "设置 `display: flex`。"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Display utilities: `block`, `inline-block`, `inline`, `flex`, `inline-flex`, and `none`."
msgstr "显示工具：`block`、`inline-block`、`inline`、`flex`、`inline-flex` 和 `none`。"

#: css/layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Text-alignment utilities: `start`, `center`, `end`, and `justify`."
msgstr "文本对齐工具：`start`、`center`、`end` 和 `justify`。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: link"
msgstr ""

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-link` — A styled hyperlink with sizes, an inverse variant for dark backgrounds, and inline or unstyled forms."
msgstr "`.instui-link` — 一个带有尺寸的样式化超链接，提供用于深色背景的反向变体，并支持内联或无样式形式。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own responsive `gap` between an icon and its text (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在图标与文本之间设置其自身的响应式 `gap`（`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` 可缩放）；链式使用 `-gap-*` 间距实用修饰符会覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [link.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/link/link.css)"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a disabled link with `aria-disabled=\"true\"`."
msgstr "使用 `aria-disabled=\"true\"` 标记禁用的链接。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For dark backgrounds."
msgstr "用于深色背景。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Inline link, underlined within flowing text."
msgstr "内联链接，在流式文本中带下划线。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "大号内联链接（与 `-inline` 一起使用）。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small inline link (used with `-inline`)."
msgstr "小号内联链接（与 `-inline` 一起使用）。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Strip link styling: inherit colour, no underline."
msgstr "去除链接样式：继承颜色，不带下划线。"

#: css/link.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — A breadcrumb trail is built from links; also its small-screen fallback (pair with the `responsive` utility to swap Breadcrumb for a Link below ~768px)."
msgstr "- [breadcrumb](/api/css/breadcrumb.md) — 面包屑导航由链接构建；也是其小屏幕回退方案（在 ~768px 以下与 `responsive` 实用工具配对以将 Breadcrumb 替换为 Link）。"

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list item (InstUI `List.Item`)."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — 列表项（InstUI `List.Item`）。"

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `list`'s `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`, `-ordered`, and `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` modifiers restyle this member — see `list`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "父级 `list` 的 `-size-sm`/`-size-lg`、`-ordered` 和 `-delimiter-solid`/`-delimiter-dashed` 修饰符会重设此成员的样式 — 有关这些修饰符，请参阅 `list` 的文档。"

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a dashed rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "使用虚线分隔项目。@affects list.item — 在项目之间添加分隔线规则。"

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Separate items with a solid rule. @affects list.item — Adds the delimiter rule between items."
msgstr "使用实线分隔项目。@affects list.item — 在项目之间添加分隔线规则。"

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Ordered-list numbering. @affects list.item — Adds marker weight and indentation."
msgstr "有序列表编号。@affects list.item — 添加标记粗细和缩进。"

#: css/list.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders the list bullet or ordered-list number."
msgstr "呈现列表符号或有序列表的编号。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: list"
msgstr ""

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-list` — A list with token-driven item spacing."
msgstr "`.instui-list` — 使用代币驱动项目间距的列表。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `padding-inline-start` for list indentation; chaining a `-p*`/`-padding*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value. See the `list.item` member for the individual items."
msgstr "为列表缩进设置其自身的 `padding-inline-start`；链接 `-p*`/`-padding*` 间距实用修饰符将覆盖该内置值。有关单个项目，请参阅 `list.item` 成员。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [list.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/list/list.css)"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay items out inline (horizontal)."
msgstr "将项目以内联方式（横向）排列。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "大。@affects list.item — 调整项目间距以匹配。`-size-lg` 的长形式别名。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Large. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "大。@affects list.item — 调整项目间距以匹配。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "中（默认）。@affects list.item — 调整项目间距以匹配。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "中（默认）。@affects list.item — 调整项目间距以匹配。`-size-md` 的长形式别名。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match."
msgstr "小。@affects list.item — 调整项目间距以匹配。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Small. @affects list.item — Scales the item spacing to match. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "小。@affects list.item — 调整项目间距以匹配。`-size-sm` 的长形式别名。"

#: css/list.md
#, no-c-format
