#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: mask"
msgstr ""

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "`.instui-mask` — 一个随文流的覆盖层，会填满其已定位的父元素并将内容居中 — 例如覆盖在卡片上的加载指示器。对于模态框，优先使用原生 `<dialog>`（其 `::backdrop` 是遮罩）。这些修饰符也都可在全局使用（独立使用或链式附加到任何其他组件）— 参见 `mask` 全局工具。"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."
msgstr "使用 backdrop-filter 模糊遮罩背后的内容。"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."
msgstr "固定在视口，覆盖其内容并置于较高的 z-index。"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: maskglobal"
msgstr ""

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "`.--mask-overlay` — 一个全局的、双份副本，来自 `mask` 组件的覆盖修饰符 — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — 可直接使用或连缀到任何组件上，无需包裹在 `.instui-mask` 元素中。"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."
msgstr "完整的遮罩覆盖（位置、居中、背景）。"

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.group"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.group"

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.group` — A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "`.group` — 带标签的分组标题（InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`）。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "`.item` — 菜单项（InstUI `Menu.Item`）；添加 -disabled、-highlighted 或 -active/[aria-checked]。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a checked item with `aria-checked=\"true\"` (same styling as `-active`)."
msgstr "将已选项目标记为 `aria-checked=\"true\"`（与 `-active` 相同的样式）。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Active/checked highlight; same styling as `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "活动/已选高亮；样式与 `[aria-checked=\"true\"]` 相同。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Muted, non-interactive."
msgstr "弱化，非交互。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlighted background/text (keyboard focus or hover)."
msgstr "高亮的背景/文本（键盘焦点或悬停）。"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary info text within the item."
msgstr "项内的次要信息文本。"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu"
msgstr "# CSS: menu"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-menu` — A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "`.instui-menu` — 一个由项目、分组和分隔符组成的下拉面板。"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compose entries as `.item` (see the `menu.item` member), label a section with `.group` (see `menu.group`), and divide sections with `.separator` (see `menu.separator`)."
msgstr "将条目组成成 `.item`（参见 `menu.item` 成员）、用 `.group` 为一个部分加标签（参见 `menu.group`），并用 `.separator` 划分各部分（参见 `menu.separator`）。"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tree-browser](/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."
msgstr "- [tree-browser](/zh-Hans/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/zh-Hans/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.separator"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.separator"

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.separator` — A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "`.separator` — 项目之间的分隔规则（InstUI `Menu.Separator`）。"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: metric"
msgstr ""

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-metric` — A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "`.instui-metric` — 带标签的统计数据 — 位于说明文字上方的大数值。"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the value and label, and its own horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values."
msgstr "在数值与标签之间设置自身的 `gap`，并设置自身的水平 `padding`；串联 `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` 间距工具修饰符会覆盖这些内建值。"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Centre the value and label."
msgstr "使数值和标签居中。"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the value and label."
msgstr "使数值和标签右对齐。"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the value and label."
msgstr "使数值和标签左对齐。"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caption beneath the value."
msgstr "位于数值下方的说明文字。"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The large metric number."
msgstr "大型度量数值。"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.body"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.body"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `&lt;img&gt;` goes full-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "父级 `modal` 的 `-overflow-fit`、`-density-compact` 和 `-color-inverse` 修改器会重新样式化此成员 —— 有关这些修改器，请参见 `modal` 自身的文档。"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.footer"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.footer"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — 操作行 (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "父级 `modal` 的 `-density-compact` 和 `-color-inverse` 修饰符会重新设置此成员的样式 — 详见 `modal` 的文档以了解这些修饰符。"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.header"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.header"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.header` — The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "`.header` — 标题行（InstUI `Modal.Header`）。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal"
msgstr ""

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — 一个对话框表面（适用于原生 &lt;dialog&gt;）；包含 header/body/footer 部分。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "参见成员 `modal.header`、`modal.body` 和 `modal.footer` 以获取各个部分。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "使用 `showModal()` 打开原生 `<dialog>` 以获得模态语义和按 Esc 关闭的行为，并使用指向 `.header` 的 `aria-labelledby` 为其命名。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "模态框后面的背景应用模糊效果。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "暗色（配合媒体主体使用）。@affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — 为每个部分着色以呈现暗色外观。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "缩紧各部分的内边距。@affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — 收紧每个部分的填充。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "限制在视口内并使主体可滚动。@affects modal.body — 当模态框被限制在视口时使主体可滚动。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "按内容尺寸自适应。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "边到边。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "一个宽型模态框。为 `-size-lg` 的长格式别名。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "一个宽型模态框。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "一个窄型模态框。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "一个窄型模态框。为 `-size-sm` 的长格式别名。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "将对话框后方的页面变暗作为其遮罩，并在 `-blur` 下对其进行毛玻璃处理。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- 为原生 &lt;dialog&gt; 及其 `::backdrop` 添加样式；顶层渲染和背景样式需要浏览器支持 dialog 元素。"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — tray 是相同的可关闭覆盖模式，但固定在屏幕边缘。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: number-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — 带有 +/- 微调列的数字输入外观。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format, pantoken-verbatim
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."
msgstr "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Put the accessible name on the `<input>` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."
msgstr "把可访问名称放在 `<input>`（例如 `aria-label`），这样字段就拥有该值；+/- 微调按钮为装饰性并标记为 `aria-hidden=\"true\"`。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium."
msgstr "（默认）中等。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "（默认）中等。是 `-size-md` 的完整形式别名。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The +/- spinner column at the inline-end."
msgstr "内联末端的 +/- 微调列。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decrement button; the unclassed button increments."
msgstr "减小值的按钮；未分类的按钮用于增加值。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked chevron glyph on each spinner button: up to increment, down on `.down`."
msgstr "每个微调按钮上的遮罩箭头图标：向上表示增加，向下表示在 `.down` 上减少。"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same input facade chrome.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — Another numeric input control."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — 使用相同的输入外观。\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — 另一种数字输入控件。"

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: overflow"
msgstr ""

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--overflow-x-hidden` — `overflow-x`/`overflow-y` as composable, global classes — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.--overflow-x-hidden` — 将 `overflow-x`/`overflow-y` 作为可组合的全局类 — `.--overflow-x-<value>` / `.--overflow-y-<value>` — 可单独使用或链式附加到任何组件上。"

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/overflow/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/overflow/index.ts)"

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
