msgstr "overflow-y: visible."

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: page-layout"
msgstr ""

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — Standard three-column page layout with header, sidebar, and main content."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-page-layout\"]` — 带有页眉、侧栏和主要内容的标准三栏页面布局。"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "✅ 在以下情况下使用 Page-Layout："

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You need a classic page structure with navigation and content areas\n- The page has a clear main content area flanked by complementary regions\n- You want consistent spacing and alignment across the layout\n🚫 Don't use Page-Layout when:"
msgstr "- 你需要带有导航和内容区域的经典页面结构\n- 页面有清晰的主要内容区域，旁边有互补的区域\n- 你希望布局在间距和对齐上保持一致\n🚫 在以下情况下不要使用 Page-Layout："

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a single-column page — use a simpler layout instead\n- The sidebar competes with main content for importance"
msgstr "- 构建单栏页面 — 改用更简单的布局\n- 侧栏与主要内容在重要性上发生竞争"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a `<main>` landmark\n- Give the sidebar `role=\"navigation\"` or `role=\"complementary\"` as appropriate\n- Ensure landmark regions have distinct aria-labels"
msgstr "- 将主要内容区域映射为 `<main>` 地标\n- 根据需要为侧栏提供 `role=\"navigation\"` 或 `role=\"complementary\"`\n- 确保地标区域具有不同的 aria-label"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Main body containing sidebar and content."
msgstr "包含侧栏和内容的主体。"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Bottom footer region."
msgstr "底部页脚区域。"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Top header region."
msgstr "顶部页眉区域。"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Central content area."
msgstr "中央内容区域。"

#: css/page-layout.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left navigation or auxiliary column."
msgstr "左侧导航或辅助列。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pagination"
msgstr ""

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pagination` — Page navigation: numbered pages, first, previous, next, and last arrows, and an ellipsis for gaps."
msgstr "`.instui-pagination` — 页面导航：带编号的页码、第一页、上一页、下一页和最后一页箭头，以及表示间隙的省略号。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `pagination.page` member for the individual page controls."
msgstr "有关单个页面控件，请参阅 `pagination.page` 成员。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [page.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pagination/members/page/page.css)"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label, mark the current page with aria-current=\"page\", give each arrow an aria-label, and disable end arrows with disabled or aria-disabled=\"true\"."
msgstr "使用 aria-label 标注 `<nav>`，用 aria-current=\"page\" 标记当前页，为每个箭头添加 aria-label，并使用 disabled 或 aria-disabled=\"true\" 禁用末端箭头。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render arrow glyph icons inside the first/prev/next/last controls."
msgstr "在第一页/上一页/下一页/最后一页 控件中渲染箭头图标。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compact variant with a page-number input."
msgstr "带有页码输入框的紧凑变体。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A first, previous, next, or last control."
msgstr "用于跳转到第一页、上一页、下一页或最后一页的控件。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The gap marker between page ranges."
msgstr "页码范围之间的间隙标记。"

#: css/pagination.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The label for the page-number input (input variant)."
msgstr "页码输入（输入框变体）的标签。"

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pagination.page"
msgstr ""

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.page` — A page link or button (InstUI `Pagination.Page`); the current page carries `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "`.page` — 页面链接或按钮（InstUI `Pagination.Page`）；当前页面带有 `[aria-current]`。"

#: css/pagination.page.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current page; same styling as `[aria-current]`."
msgstr "当前页面；与 `[aria-current]` 具有相同的样式。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: pill"
msgstr ""

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-pill` — A compact status label; add a leading glyph with the shared `-icon-<name>` form."
msgstr "`.instui-pill` — 紧凑的状态标签；使用共享的 `-icon-<name>` 形式添加前置图标。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Unlike `badge`, which shows a count, or `tag`, which is removable, the pill is a static status label; its leading glyph is a masked `::before`, not an `<img>`."
msgstr "不同于 `badge`（显示计数）或 `tag`（可移除），pill 是一个静态状态标签；其前置图标是一个掩码的 `::before`，而不是 `<img>`。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [pill.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pill/pill.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [pill.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/pill/pill.css)"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Error status."
msgstr "错误状态。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Informational status."
msgstr "信息状态。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Positive status."
msgstr "成功状态。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Cautionary status."
msgstr "警告状态。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leading glyph from the icon set (e.g. `-icon-check`), painted before the label."
msgstr "来自图标集合的前置图标（例如 `-icon-check`），绘于标签之前。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — The former `renderIcon` prop; still works as an alias, but use `-icon-<name>` instead."
msgstr ""

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The leading icon glyph, sized and spaced to the pill."
msgstr "用于 pill 的前置图标，已调整为合适的大小和间距。"

#: css/pill.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — A badge is the count or notification counterpart.\n- [tag](/api/css/tag.md) — A tag is the removable, form-oriented counterpart."
msgstr "- [badge](/api/css/badge.md) — 徽章用于显示计数或通知。\n- [tag](/api/css/tag.md) — 标签是可移除的、面向表单的对应项。"

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: popover"
msgstr ""

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-popover` — An elevated surface for a native `[popover]`, positioned with CSS anchor positioning."
msgstr "`.instui-popover` — 一个为原生 `[popover]` 提供的提升表面，使用 CSS 锚点定位。"

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Anchor positioning is Chromium-only; the `@supports` guard means `-placement-*` is silently inert elsewhere and the UA centers the popover in the top layer instead of failing."
msgstr "锚点定位仅在 Chromium 中可用；`@supports` 保护意味着在其他环境中 `-placement-*` 将静默失效，浏览器代理会将弹出层置于顶层并居中，而不是出错。"

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [popover.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/popover/popover.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [popover.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/popover/popover.css)"

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Uses CSS anchor positioning (`position-anchor`/`position-area`) and the native `[popover]` API, both Chromium-only today; an `@supports` guard keeps the placement inert elsewhere, where the UA centres the popover in the top layer."
msgstr "- 使用 CSS 锚点定位（`position-anchor`/`position-area`）和原生 `[popover]` API，两者目前均仅在 Chromium 可用；`@supports` 保护在其他环境中使放置无效，浏览器代理会将弹出层置于顶层并居中。"

#: css/popover.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — A tooltip is a smaller, hover- or focus-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — Context view is a related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [tooltip](/api/css/tooltip.md) — 工具提示是一个较小的、由悬停或聚焦触发的锚定表面。\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — 上下文视图是一个相关的、带指针的锚定表面。"

#: css/position.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: position"
msgstr ""

#: css/position.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--position-relative` — `position` as a composable, global class — `.--position-<value>` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--position-relative`)."
