msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate the meter, ring, and centered value into place on mount."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default)."
msgstr "中等（默认）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Medium (default). Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "中等（默认）。`-size-md` 的长格式别名。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text centred in the ring's hole."
msgstr "位于环中心孔内的数值文本（居中）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; spins `::before` at a fixed arc and hides `.value`."
msgstr "自定义，非 InstUI 一部分。仅适用于缺少其 `value` 属性的原生 `<progress>`；以固定弧旋转 `::before` 并隐藏 `.value`。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the ring itself: a conic-gradient donut clipped with a radial mask, whose arc tracks the `--value` custom property."
msgstr "绘制环本身：一个用径向掩码裁剪的锥形渐变甜甜圈，其弧线跟踪 `--value` 自定义属性。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Milliseconds to wait before starting the mount animation (default `0`)."
msgstr "开始挂载动画前要等待的毫秒数（默认 `0`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "最大进度值（默认 `100`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The minimum meter value (default `0`)."
msgstr "最小表盘值（默认 `0`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled arc (meter) colour; the -color-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "已填充弧（表盘）颜色；由 -color-* 修饰符设置。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The ring's stroke width; the -size-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "环的描边宽度；由 -size-* 修饰符设置。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The unfilled track colour."
msgstr "未填充轨道颜色。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value; registered with @property so it can transition."
msgstr "当前进度值；已用 @property 注册以便可过渡。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias {@link --max} The maximum progress value (default `100`)."
msgstr "@alias {@link --max} 最大进度值（默认 `100`）。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "@alias Alias for `--value`."
msgstr "@alias `--value` 的别名。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Registers the numeric progress properties with `@property` and paints with CSS `mask` and `conic-gradient`; where custom-property transitions are unsupported the ring still renders but won't animate."
msgstr "- 使用 `@property` 注册数值进度属性，并使用 CSS 的 `mask` 和 `conic-gradient` 进行绘制；在不支持自定义属性过渡的地方，环仍会渲染但不会动画。"

#: css/progress-circle.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — The linear bar form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress](/api/css/progress.md) — 相同确定性进度的线性条形形式。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: progress"
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — A determinate progress bar with a coloured meter, sizes, and an optional value label."
msgstr "`.instui-progress` · <span class=\"instui-pill -color-success pantoken-doc-tag\">stable</span> — 一个确定性的进度条，带有彩色刻度、各种尺寸和可选的数值标签。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.value` is a sibling of `.bar`, both children of the root — mirroring how progress-circle nests its own `.value` part. InstUI has no indeterminate state; `:indeterminate` is a pantoken-only best guess (native `<progress>` without a `value` attribute), animating `.bar` as a sliding segment and hiding `.value` since there's no meaningful number to show. `<meter>` has no indeterminate state, so it's unaffected."
msgstr "`.value` 与 `.bar` 为同级，皆为根元素的子项——类似 progress-circle 嵌套其自身 `.value` 部分的方式。InstUI 没有不确定状态；`:indeterminate` 是 pantoken 的最佳猜测（原生 `<progress>` 且缺少 `value` 属性），将 `.bar` 动画为滑动段并隐藏 `.value`，因为没有可显示的有意义数字。`<meter>` 没有不确定状态，因此不受影响。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [progress.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/progress/progress.css)"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders `.value` inside the track, aligned to its start, instead of beside it; style it for legibility over the meter colour."
msgstr "在轨道内将 `.value` 渲染为靠起点对齐，而不是并排显示；请为其设置样式以便在刻度颜色上保持可读性。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — Animate meter changes over half a second."
msgstr ""

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled meter bar."
msgstr "填充的刻度条。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The value text beside the bar."
msgstr "位于刻度旁的数值文本。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Custom, not part of InstUI. Applies only to a native `<progress>` missing its `value` attribute; animates `.bar` as a sliding segment and hides `.value`."
msgstr "自定义，不属于 InstUI。仅适用于缺少 `value` 属性的原生 `<progress>`；将 `.bar` 动画为滑动段并隐藏 `.value`。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the track's bottom rule as its own layer over the meter, so the full border and the bottom border stay independent across themes."
msgstr "将轨道的底部规则绘制为独立于刻度的图层，使完整边框和底部边框在不同主题中保持独立。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The current progress value."
msgstr "当前的进度值。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Scopes the meter part rules with the `@scope` at-rule; browsers without `@scope` support ignore those scoped rules."
msgstr "- 使用 `@scope` at-rule 对刻度部分的规则进行作用域限定；不支持 `@scope` 的浏览器会忽略这些作用域规则。"

#: css/progress.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — The circular form of the same determinate progress."
msgstr "- [progress-circle](/api/css/progress-circle.md) — 同一确定性进度的圆形形式。"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: prose"
msgstr "# CSS: prose"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`:where(body)` — Typographic defaults for raw HTML — headings, paragraphs, lists, links, and code — applied automatically wherever it's imported (default `:where(body)`); pass `options.scope` to target a different content root instead (e.g. `.vp-doc`)."
msgstr "`:where(body)` — 原始 HTML 的排版默认设置 — 标题、段落、列表、链接 和 代码 — 在导入到任何位置时会自动应用（默认 `:where(body)`）；如果要针对不同的内容根，请传入 `options.scope`（例如 `.vp-doc`）。"

#: css/prose.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/rules/prose/index.ts)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio-input-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio-input-group` — A single-select radio `<fieldset>`, plain or as a connected segmented toggle."
msgstr "`.instui-radio-input-group` — 单选的 `<fieldset>`，可为普通样式或作为连接的分段切换器。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between radios; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在单个单选按钮之间设置其自身的 `gap`；链式使用 `-gap-*` 间距实用修饰符将覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio-input-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio-input-group/radio-input-group.css)"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renders a native `<fieldset>` with a `<legend>` that names the group; the child radios share one `name`, so only one can be selected at a time."
msgstr "呈现原生的 `<fieldset>`，并使用命名组的 `<legend>`；子单选按钮共享同一个 `name`，因此一次只能选中一个。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Toggle variant"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out in columns."
msgstr "将单选按钮按列布局。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the radios out inline."
msgstr "将单选按钮以内联方式布局。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Lay the child toggles out as a segmented control (only the selected segment fills)."
msgstr "将子切换项布局为分段控件（仅所选分段填充）。"

#: css/radio-input-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — The individual control this group collects.\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — The general wrapper for grouping and laying out fields."
msgstr "- [radio](/api/css/radio.md) — 本组收集的单个控件。\n- [form-field-group](/api/css/form-field-group.md) — 用于分组和布局字段的一般包装器。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: radio"
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-radio` — A native radio button and its label."
msgstr "`.instui-radio` — 原生单选按钮及其标签。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the control and its label; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在控件与其标签之间设置自身的 `gap`；链式使用 `-gap-*` 间距实用修饰符可覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [radio.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/radio/radio.css)"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A native `<input type=\"radio\">` drives `:checked` and `:disabled`; `-readonly` is styling only, since radios have no native readonly attribute."
msgstr "原生 `<input type=\"radio\">` 驱动 `:checked` 与 `:disabled`；`-readonly` 仅用于样式，因为单选按钮没有原生只读属性。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Danger context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "危险情境颜色（切换变体）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Off/neutral context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "关闭/中性情境颜色（切换变体）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Success context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "成功情境颜色（切换变体）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Warning context colour (toggle variant)."
msgstr "警告情境颜色（切换变体）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-info pantoken-doc-tag\">Alias</span> — maps to `.-variant-toggle`."
msgstr ""

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render as a segmented toggle button."
msgstr "呈现为分段切换按钮（segmented toggle button）。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The filled inner dot shown when checked; on `-variant-toggle` it is the focus ring drawn just outside the pill."
msgstr "选中时显示的填充内点；在 `-variant-toggle` 上它是绘制在 pill 外侧的焦点环。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The toggle's selected fill colour; the -context-* modifiers set it."
msgstr "切换项的选中填充颜色；由 -context-* 修饰符设置。"

#: css/radio.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — The multi-select counterpart to a single-select radio.\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — Collects radios into one single-select fieldset."
msgstr "- [checkbox](/api/css/checkbox.md) — 多选（用于与单选 radio 对应）。\n- [radio-input-group](/api/css/radio-input-group.md) — 将多个单选按钮收集为单一的单选字段集。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: range-input"
msgstr ""

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-range-input` — A styled range slider with an inverse value bubble."
msgstr "`.instui-range-input` — 带有反向数值气泡的样式化范围滑块。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each vendor thumb/track pseudo-element needs its own separate rule — grouping them in one selector list would invalidate the whole rule in browsers that don't recognize the other vendor's pseudo."
msgstr "每个厂商的 thumb/track 伪元素需要单独的规则 —— 将它们归并到同一个选择器列表会在不识别另一个厂商伪元素的浏览器中使整条规则无效。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [range-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/range-input/range-input.css)"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The control is a native `<input type=\"range\">`; give it an accessible name with `aria-label` or an associated `<label>`."
msgstr "该控件是原生的 `<input type=\"range\">`；请使用 `aria-label` 或与之关联的 `<label>` 为其提供可访问名称。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the value bubble's caret, a small triangle pointing back toward the track."
msgstr "绘制数值气泡的指示三角（caret），一个指向轨道的小三角形。"

#: css/range-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — The typed numeric-entry counterpart."
msgstr "- [number-input](/api/css/number-input.md) — 用于键入数值的对应控件。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rating"
msgstr ""

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-rating` — A star rating with filled and empty glyphs and an optional numeric label."
msgstr "`.instui-rating` — 一个带有填充与空心字形且可选数字标签的星级评分。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between star glyphs; chaining a `-gap-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "在星形字形之间设置其自身的 `gap`；链式使用 `-gap-*` 间距工具修饰符会覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [rating.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/rating/rating.css)"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give it role=\"img\" and an aria-label stating the rating, since the stars are icon glyphs."
msgstr "为其添加 role=\"img\" 和 aria-label 来说明评分，因为这些星为图标字形。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render star glyphs with icon classes (for example, `-icon-star-solid`)."
msgstr "使用图标类渲染星形字形（例如，`-icon-star-solid`）。"

#: css/rating.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The numeric label, e.g. \"3/5\"."
msgstr "数字标签，例如 \"3/5\"。"

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: responsive"
msgstr ""

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — Viewport- or container-width show/hide classes across a themed breakpoint scale."
msgstr "`[class*=\"-hidden-\"],[class*=\"-show-\"]` — 在主题断点尺度上，按视口或容器宽度显示/隐藏的类。"

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` hide by viewport width; `.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` are the inverse (hidden by default, shown only inside the range via `display: revert`); the `-cq-` variants react to a `.instui-container` ancestor's width instead, not the viewport's. Scale tiers `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl` (sourced from the IR's tray-width component tokens) are each aliased to a long-form spelling (`x-small`–`x-large`) and a device name (`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`) — both deprecated in favor of the short name — plus the unscaled, themed `content`/`content-full-width` tiers (the main content area's max-width)."
msgstr "`.instui-hidden-max-<bp>`/`-hidden-min-<bp>` 根据视口宽度隐藏；`.instui-show-max-<bp>`/`-show-min-<bp>` 则相反（默认隐藏，仅在范围内通过 `display: revert` 显示）；`-cq-` 变体改为响应 `.instui-container` 祖先的宽度，而不是视口。比例级别 `xs`/`sm`/`md`/`lg`/`xl`（来自 IR 的 tray-width 组件令牌）分别有长格式拼写别名（`x-small`–`x-large`）和设备名称（`mobile`/`phablet`/`tablet`/`laptop`/`desktop`）— 两者均已弃用，建议使用短名称 — 以及未缩放的主题化 `content`/`content-full-width` 级别（主内容区域的最大宽度）。"

#: css/responsive.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/responsive/index.ts)"

