#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: rubric-note"
msgstr ""

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — Structured note with rubric categories and scoring indicators."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-rubric-note\"]` — 带评分类别和评分指示器的结构化注释。"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "✅ 在以下情况下使用 Rubric-Note："

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying grading rubric or assessment criteria\n- You need to structure content by category with scores or indicators\n- The layout should emphasize structure and hierarchy\n🚫 Don't use Rubric-Note when:"
msgstr "- 显示评分量表或评估标准\n- 需要按类别用分数或指示器对内容进行结构化\n- 布局应强调结构与层级\n🚫 在以下情况下不要使用 Rubric-Note："

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Displaying simple notes or comments — use Callout instead\n- Complex grading logic is needed — consider a custom component"
msgstr "- 显示简单注释或评论 — 请改用 Callout\n- 需要复杂的评分逻辑 — 考虑使用自定义组件"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Use table semantics if displaying a true rubric with rows and columns\n- Ensure score indicators are not color-only\n- Provide descriptive labels for each category"
msgstr "- 如果要展示具有行列的真实评分量表，请使用表格语义\n- 确保评分指示器不仅依赖颜色\n- 为每个类别提供描述性标签"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Container for rubric criteria rows."
msgstr "评分标准行的容器。"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Detailed description of the criterion."
msgstr "评分标准的详细描述。"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Header with title and metadata."
msgstr "包含标题和元数据的头部。"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Criterion name or category."
msgstr "评分标准名称或类别。"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Individual criterion row."
msgstr "单个评分标准行。"

#: css/rubric-note.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Score indicator or badge."
msgstr "分数指示器或徽章。"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: screen-reader-content"
msgstr "# CSS: screen-reader-content"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — Visually hides content while keeping it available to assistive tech (the standard clip pattern)."
msgstr "`.instui-screen-reader-content` — 在视觉上隐藏内容，同时保持其对辅助技术可用（标准的裁剪模式）。"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [screen-reader-content.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/screen-reader-content/screen-reader-content.css)"

#: css/screen-reader-content.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keeps text in the accessibility tree for screen readers while removing it from the visual layout."
msgstr "将文本保留在可访问性树中以供屏幕阅读器使用，同时将其从视觉布局中移除。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar.item"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A navigation entry (InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.item` — 一个导航项（InstUI `SideNavBar.Item`）；`-selected` 标记为活动项。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `side-nav-bar`'s `-minimized` modifier hides this member's `.label` — see `side-nav-bar`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "父级 `side-nav-bar` 的 `-minimized` 修饰符会隐藏该成员的 `.label` — 有关该修饰符，请参见 `side-nav-bar` 的文档。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active nav item."
msgstr "活动的导航项。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The item's text label; hidden when the rail is minimized."
msgstr "该项的文本标签；当侧栏收起时隐藏。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: side-nav-bar"
msgstr ""

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — A vertical navigation rail of icon-over-label items, with a minimized icons-only mode."
msgstr "`.instui-side-nav-bar` — 一个垂直导航栏，由图标位于标签上方的条目组成，并带有最小化的仅图标模式。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between nav items and its own `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values. See the `side-nav-bar.item` member for the individual nav entries."
msgstr "在导航项之间以及其自身与 `padding` 之间设置其自己的 `gap`；链式使用 `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` 间距工具修饰符将覆盖这些内置值。有关各个导航条目的信息，请参见 `side-nav-bar.item` 成员。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [item.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/side-nav-bar/members/item/item.css)"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the `<nav>` with aria-label so it's announced as a named navigation landmark."
msgstr "使用 aria-label 为 `<nav>` 添加标签，以便其被宣告为命名的导航地标。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a glyph icon in each nav item."
msgstr "在每个导航项中渲染一个字形图标。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Collapse to icons only (labels hidden). @affects side-nav-bar.item — Hides the item's label."
msgstr "折叠为仅显示图标（标签隐藏）。 @affects side-nav-bar.item — 隐藏该项的标签。"

#: css/side-nav-bar.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The nav item's text label."
msgstr "导航项的文本标签。"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: simple-select"
msgstr ""

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-simple-select` — A styled native `<select>` with a caret, matching the text-input states and sizes."
msgstr "`.instui-simple-select` — 带样式的原生 `<select>`，带有小箭头，与文本输入的状态和尺寸相匹配。"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wraps a plain native `<select>` with no custom dropdown/menu markup, so browser-native option rendering and keyboard behavior apply as-is; it shares its field chrome with `text-input`."
msgstr "包装一个原生的 `<select>`（无自定义下拉/菜单标记），因此浏览器原生的选项渲染和键盘行为保持不变；它与 `text-input` 共享相同的字段外观。"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [select.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/select/select.css)"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The placeholder text, in a muted color that shifts on hover."
msgstr "占位文本，使用灰暗的颜色，悬停时会发生变化。"

#: css/simple-select.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same field chrome, states, and sizes.\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — The dropdown surface a richer select reuses."
msgstr "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — 共享相同的字段外观、状态和尺寸。\n- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — 更丰富的 select 所复用的下拉面板。"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spacing"
msgstr ""

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--p-md` — Margin and padding utilities — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` and `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` on the spacing scale (sides `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` or none, spelled short or fully long — for example `--mb-sm` and `--margin-bottom-small` are the same rule; margin also takes `auto`). Usable bare or chained onto any component (for example `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`)."
msgstr "`.--p-md` — 外边距和内边距工具 — `.--m<side>-<step>` / `.--margin-<side>-<step>` 和 `.--p<side>-<step>` / `.--padding-<side>-<step>` 在间距刻度上（边 `t`/`b`/`s`/`e`/`x`/`y` 或 无，支持短写或完整长写 — 例如 `--mb-sm` 和 `--margin-bottom-small` 是相同规则；外边距还接受 `auto`）。可单独使用或链式附加到任意组件（例如 `class=\"instui-view --mb-sm\"`）。"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/spacing/index.ts)"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Applies medium padding on all sides."
msgstr "在所有侧应用中等内边距。"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Margin utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "外边距工具，支持短写、旧式长写和完整长写。"

#: css/spacing.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Padding utilities across short, legacy-long, and fully long spellings."
msgstr "内边距工具，支持短写、旧式长写和完整长写。"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: spinner"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-spinner` — An animated loading ring; give it role=\"status\" and an aria-label."
msgstr "`.instui-spinner` — 一个动画加载环；为其添加 role=\"status\" 和 aria-label。"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`-color-inverse` only repaints the animated top border segment, not the whole track, so it still reads correctly on a dark card without needing a separate track color."
msgstr "`-color-inverse` 仅重新绘制动画的顶部边框段，而不是整个轨道，因此在深色卡片上仍能正确显示，无需单独的轨道颜色。"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [spinner.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/spinner/spinner.css)"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Give the spinner role=\"status\" and an aria-label so screen readers announce it as a live loading status."
msgstr "为该加载器添加 role=\"status\" 和 aria-label，以便屏幕阅读器将其宣布为实时加载状态。"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### Inverse color -nocard"
msgstr ""

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On a dark surface."
msgstr "在深色表面上。"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small. Long-form alias of `-size-xs`."
msgstr "极小。`-size-xs` 的长写别名。"

#: css/spinner.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Extra-small."
msgstr "极小。"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: stacking"
msgstr ""

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--stack-topmost` — z-index depth utilities — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — usable bare or chained onto any component, so layers stack predictably instead of by hand-tuned numbers."
msgstr "`.--stack-topmost` — z-index 深度工具 — `.--stack-<level>` (`deepest`, `below`, `above`, `topmost`) — 可单独使用或链式应用于任何组件，使图层按可预测顺序堆叠，而不是手动调整数值。"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/stacking/index.ts)"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Above the default flow."
msgstr "高于默认流。"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Below the default flow."
msgstr "低于默认流。"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The lowest stacking depth."
msgstr "最低的堆叠深度。"

#: css/stacking.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The highest stacking depth (overlays, menus)."
msgstr "最高的堆叠深度（覆盖层、菜单）。"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.body"
msgstr "# CSS: table.body"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tbody` — The table's data row group (InstUI `Table.Body`)."
msgstr "`tbody` — 表格的数据行组（InstUI `Table.Body`）。"

#: css/table.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier restyles this member — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "父级 `table` 的 `-layout-stacked` 修改器重新样式化了此成员 — 有关该修改器，请参见 `table` 的文档。"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.cell"
msgstr "# CSS: table.cell"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`td` — A data cell (InstUI `Table.Cell`)."
msgstr "`td` — 一个数据单元（InstUI `Table.Cell`）。"

#: css/table.cell.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier stacks this member as a block and labels it via `::before` — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "父级 `table` 的 `-layout-stacked` 修饰符将此成员堆叠为块并通过 `::before` 为其添加标签 — 参见 `table` 的文档以了解该修饰符。"

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.col-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.col-header"

#: css/table.col-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th` — A column-header cell (InstUI `Table.ColHeader`); the default `th` styling, overridden by `table.row-header` for `th[scope=\"row\"]`."
msgstr "`th` — 列头单元格（InstUI `Table.ColHeader`）；默认的 `th` 样式，已被用于 `th[scope=\"row\"]` 的 `table.row-header` 覆盖。"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.head"
msgstr "# CSS: table.head"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`thead` — The table's header row group (InstUI `Table.Head`)."
msgstr "`thead` — 表格的表头行组（InstUI `Table.Head`）。"

#: css/table.head.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-layout-stacked` modifier visually hides this member (its column titles surface per-cell instead) — see `table`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "父级 `table` 的 `-layout-stacked` 修饰符在视觉上隐藏了该成员（其列标题改为每个单元格显示）— 参见 `table` 的文档以了解该修饰符。"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table"
msgstr ""

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-table` — A styled data table for `th` and `td` plus an optional caption, with hover, fixed, and stacked-card layouts."
msgstr "`.instui-table` — 一个为 `th` 和 `td` 提供的样式化数据表，并可选带标题，支持悬停、固定和堆叠卡片布局。"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "For `-layout-stacked`, pure CSS can't pull each column header's text into its cell, so give every cell a `data-label` and the stacked card shows it via `::before`. See the `table.head`, `table.body`, `table.row`, `table.cell`, `table.col-header`, and `table.row-header` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "对于 `-layout-stacked`，纯 CSS 无法将每个列头的文本提取到其单元格内，因此应为每个单元格添加一个 `data-label`，堆叠卡片通过 `::before` 显示该文本。有关各个部分，请参阅 `table.head`、`table.body`、`table.row`、`table.cell`、`table.col-header` 和 `table.row-header` 成员。"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/table/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Label the table with a `<caption>`, mark column headers `<th scope=\"col\">` and row headers `<th scope=\"row\">`, and in `-layout-stacked` give every cell a `data-label` since the header row is visually hidden."
msgstr "使用 `<caption>` 为表格添加标签，将列头标记为 `<th scope=\"col\">`、行头标记为 `<th scope=\"row\">`，并在 `-layout-stacked` 中为每个单元格提供一个 `data-label`，因为表头行在视觉上被隐藏。"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlight rows on hover. @affects table.row — Reserves and colours the row's hover border."
msgstr "悬停时高亮行。@affects table.row — 保留并着色该行的悬停边框。"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed table layout (equal-width columns)."
msgstr "固定表格布局（等宽列）。"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Stack each row as a card, via a per-cell `data-label`. @affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — Stacks each part as a block and hides/labels the header accordingly."
msgstr "通过每单元格的 `data-label` 将每一行堆叠为卡片。@affects table.head @affects table.body @affects table.row @affects table.cell @affects table.col-header @affects table.row-header — 将各部分作为块级元素堆叠，并相应地隐藏/标注表头。"

#: css/table.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "An optional table caption."
msgstr "可选的表格标题。"

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row-header"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row-header"

#: css/table.row-header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — A row-header cell (InstUI `Table.RowHeader`); styled from the row-header tokens, not the column-header ones."
msgstr "`th[scope=\"row\"]` — 一个行头单元格（InstUI `Table.RowHeader`）；样式来自行头的令牌，而非列头的令牌。"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: table.row"
msgstr "# CSS: table.row"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`tr` — A table row (InstUI `Table.Row`)."
msgstr "`tr` — 一个表格行（InstUI `Table.Row`）。"

#: css/table.row.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `table`'s `-hover` and `-layout-stacked` modifiers restyle this member — see `table`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "父级 `table` 的 `-hover` 和 `-layout-stacked` 修饰符会重新设置此成员的样式 — 有关这些修饰符，请参见 `table` 的文档。"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tabs` — A tabbed panel set: a tab list, selectable tabs, and their panels."
msgstr "`.instui-tabs` — 选项卡面板集：一个选项卡列表、可选择的选项卡及其面板。"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `tabs.tab` and `tabs.panel` members for the individual tab buttons and their content panels."
msgstr "请参阅 `tabs.tab` 和 `tabs.panel` 成员，了解各单独选项卡按钮及其内容面板。"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [panel.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tabs/members/panel/panel.css)"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire the tab list with role=\"tablist\", each tab with role=\"tab\" and aria-selected, and each panel with role=\"tabpanel\"."
msgstr "为选项卡列表设置 role=\"tablist\"，为每个选项卡设置 role=\"tab\" 和 aria-selected，为每个面板设置 role=\"tabpanel\"。"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Keep the tab list on one line and let it scroll horizontally instead of wrapping, hiding the scrollbar."
msgstr "保持选项卡列表在同一行并让其水平滚动而不是换行，同时隐藏滚动条。"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Rounded \"folder\" tabs with a selected tab that visually connects into the panel below. @affects tabs.tab — Restyles the tab buttons into the rounded \"folder\" look."
msgstr "圆角“文件夹”样式的选项卡，所选选项卡在视觉上与下方面板相连。@affects tabs.tab — 将选项卡按钮重新样式为圆角“文件夹”外观。"

#: css/tabs.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The row of tabs."
msgstr "选项卡行。"

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.panel"
msgstr "# CSS: tabs.panel"

#: css/tabs.panel.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.panel` — The content panel for a tab (InstUI `Tabs.Panel`)."
msgstr "`.panel` — 选项卡的内容面板（InstUI `Tabs.Panel`）。"

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tabs.tab"
msgstr ""

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.tab` — A single tab button (InstUI `Tabs.Tab`, configured via the parent `Tabs`'s tab list); `-selected` marks the active one."
msgstr "`.tab` — 单个选项卡按钮（InstUI `Tabs.Tab`，通过父级 `Tabs` 的选项卡列表配置）；`-selected` 标记为活动项。"

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `tabs`'s `-variant-secondary` modifier restyles this member into a rounded \"folder\" tab — see `tabs`'s own doc for that modifier."
msgstr "父级 `tabs` 的 `-variant-secondary` 修饰符将此成员重样式为圆角「文件夹」选项卡 — 有关该修饰符，请参见 `tabs` 的文档。"

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Non-interactive; same styling as `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled`."
msgstr "不可交互；样式与 `[aria-disabled=\"true\"]`/`:disabled` 相同。"

#: css/tabs.tab.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The active tab; same styling as `[aria-selected=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "活动选项卡；样式与 `[aria-selected=\"true\"]` 相同。"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tag"
msgstr ""

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tag` — An inline chip for a keyword or filter."
msgstr "`.instui-tag` — 用于关键字或筛选的内联小标签。"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own horizontal `padding` (`-size-sm`/`-size-lg` scale it); chaining a `-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides that built-in value."
msgstr "设置其自身的水平 `padding`（由 `-size-sm`/`-size-lg` 缩放）；串联 `-p-*`/`-padding-*` 间距实用修饰符会覆盖该内置值。"

#: css/tag.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tag.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tag/tag.css)"
