#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-details"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-details` — A styled native `<details>` disclosure with a rotating chevron."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-details` — 带有旋转箭头的样式化原生 `<details>` 折叠面板。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the native `<details>` element, so the browser drives open and close plus keyboard support; the CSS only hides the default marker and supplies the rotating chevron."
msgstr "基于原生 `<details>` 元素构建，因此浏览器负责控制展开/关闭及键盘支持；CSS 仅隐藏默认标记并提供旋转箭头。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-details.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-details/toggle-details.css)"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Place the chevron after the summary."
msgstr "将箭头放在摘要之后。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Filled (surface) variant."
msgstr "实心（表面）变体。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the disclosure is open."
msgstr "绘制摘要的折叠箭头：一个带蒙版的字形，在折叠打开时旋转指向下方。"

#: css/toggle-details.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — The bordered, grouped form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-group](/api/css/toggle-group.md) — 相同折叠组件的有边框分组形式。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: toggle-group"
msgstr ""

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-toggle-group` — A bordered disclosure built on `<details>`: a chevron summary row and collapsible content."
msgstr "`.instui-toggle-group` — 基于 `<details>` 构建的带边框可展开控件：一个带小折叠箭头的摘要行和可折叠内容。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Built on the same native `<details>` foundation as toggle-details; put the `<summary>` first so it becomes the clickable header row and the rest is the collapsible content."
msgstr "与 toggle-details 使用相同的原生 `<details>` 基础；将 `<summary>` 放在前面，使其成为可点击的标题行，其余部分为可折叠内容。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [toggle-group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/toggle-group/toggle-group.css)"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws the summary row's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the group is open."
msgstr "绘制摘要行的展开箭头（一个带掩膜的字形），当组展开时会旋转指向下方。"

#: css/toggle-group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — The single, unbordered form of the same disclosure."
msgstr "- [toggle-details](/api/css/toggle-details.md) — 相同展开控件的单一无边框形式。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tooltip"
msgstr ""

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tooltip` — A CSS hover and focus tooltip bubble, positionable on any side."
msgstr "`.instui-tooltip` — 一个 CSS 悬停与聚焦的提示气泡，可定位在任意一侧。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Toggling is pure CSS (`:hover`/`:focus-within`), so the bubble only reaches keyboard users through a focusable trigger; unlike `popover`, it isn't dismissible or click-triggered."
msgstr "切换为纯 CSS（`:hover`/`:focus-within`），因此该气泡仅能通过可聚焦的触发器供键盘用户访问；与 `popover` 不同，它不可取消且不会由点击触发。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tooltip.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tooltip/tooltip.css)"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Point the trigger at the bubble with aria-describedby and give the bubble role=\"tooltip\"."
msgstr "使用 aria-describedby 将触发器指向气泡，并为气泡设置 role=\"tooltip\"。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render a trigger glyph icon next to the tooltip bubble."
msgstr "在提示气泡旁渲染一个触发字形图标。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The bubble; `-placement-*` sets its side."
msgstr "气泡；其位置由 `-placement-*` 决定。"

#: css/tooltip.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The larger, click-triggered anchored surface.\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — A related anchored surface with a pointer."
msgstr "- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — 更大、由点击触发的锚定表面。\n- [context-view](/api/css/context-view.md) — 带指针的相关锚定表面。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: transition"
msgstr ""

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — Animation state classes for the `Transition` component — `.instui-transition` and state classes (`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited`, etc.) — usable bare or chained onto any component."
msgstr "`.instui-transition.-transition-fade-entering` — 用于 `Transition` 组件的动画状态类 — `.instui-transition` 与状态类（`-transition-fade-entering`, `-transition-scale-exited` 等）— 可单独使用或链式附加到任何组件上。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [transition.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/transition/transition.css)"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Transition type/state class toggled by runtime (`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`)."
msgstr "由运行时切换的过渡类型/状态类（`fade\\|scale\\|slide-*` + `entering\\|entered\\|exiting\\|exited`）。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation duration (default `300ms`); override to speed up or slow down every transition state."
msgstr "动画持续时间（默认 `300ms`）；可覆盖以加快或减慢所有过渡状态。"

#: css/transition.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Animation timing function (default `ease-in-out`)."
msgstr "动画时间函数（默认 `ease-in-out`）。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tray"
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tray` — An edge-pinned panel that slides in from any side; a native `[popover]` or `<dialog>`."
msgstr "`.instui-tray` — 一个固定在边缘的面板，可从任一侧滑入；等同于原生的 `[popover]` 或 `<dialog>`。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start/end placements resolve against `inset-inline` (logical, direction-aware); the slide-in transform mirrors automatically under an ancestor `[dir=\"rtl\"]`, so no extra markup is needed for right-to-left layouts."
msgstr "起始/结束位置相对于 `inset-inline`（逻辑、方向感知）解析；在祖先 `[dir=\"rtl\"]` 下滑入变换会自动镜像，因此在从右到左的布局中无需额外标记。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tray.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tray/tray.css)"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The tray is a dialog or popover surface, so name it with `aria-label` or `aria-labelledby`, and its close control carries an `aria-label` (the `.instui-close-button` in the example uses `aria-label=\"Close\"`)."
msgstr "托盘是对话框或弹出层表面，因此使用 `aria-label` 或 `aria-labelledby` 为其命名，关闭控件应带有 `aria-label`（示例中的 `.instui-close-button` 使用了 `aria-label=\"Close\"`）。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the bottom edge."
msgstr "固定在底部边缘。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the end (inline-end) edge."
msgstr "固定在结束（inline-end）边缘。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Pin to the start (inline-start) edge."
msgstr "（默认）固定在起始（inline-start）边缘。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pin to the top edge."
msgstr "固定在顶部边缘。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill -color-danger pantoken-doc-tag\">Deprecated</span> — use `.-size-md`."
msgstr ""

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Opens with the native `[popover]` API and `@starting-style`; the slide-in sits behind an `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` guard, so browsers without it still open the tray, just without the slide."
msgstr "- 使用原生 `[popover]` API 和 `@starting-style` 打开；滑入效果位于 `@supports (transition-behavior: allow-discrete)` 保护之后，因此在不支持该保护的浏览器中仍会打开托盘，只是没有滑动效果。"

#: css/tray.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — The same dismissible overlay pattern, centred instead of edge-pinned.\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — The generic top-layer surface this builds on."
msgstr "- [modal](/api/css/modal.md) — 相同的可解除覆盖模式，但居中而非固定在边缘。\n- [popover](/api/css/popover.md) — 构建此功能的通用顶层表面。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: tree-browser"
msgstr ""

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-tree-browser` — A disclosure tree of nested collections and leaf items, with rotating chevrons."
msgstr "`.instui-tree-browser` — 一个具有可旋转指示箭头的嵌套集合与叶子项的展开树。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Each collection is a native `<details>`; nesting them inside one another builds the tree, and the browser handles opening and closing every branch."
msgstr "每个集合都是原生的 `<details>`；将它们相互嵌套可构建树结构，浏览器负责处理每个分支的展开与收起。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [tree-browser.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/tree-browser/tree-browser.css)"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark the root with role=\"tree\" and each nested list with role=\"group\"."
msgstr "将根节点标记为 role=\"tree\"，并将每个嵌套列表标记为 role=\"group\"。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Render folder/file glyph icons in summaries and leaf items."
msgstr "在摘要和叶子项中渲染文件夹/文件图标。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A leaf entry in the tree."
msgstr "树中的一个叶子条目。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Draws each collection's disclosure chevron, a masked glyph that rotates to point down when the branch is open."
msgstr "绘制每个集合的展开指示箭头（使用蒙版的图形），当分支打开时旋转指向下方。"

#: css/tree-browser.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries."
msgstr "- [menu](/api/css/menu.md) — 两者都显示嵌套的可选条目。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: truncate"
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--truncate` — Ellipsis truncation with line clamping controlled by `--lines` — usable bare or chained onto any component (`.instui-button.--truncate`)."
msgstr "`.--truncate` — 使用行数限制的省略显示，由 `--lines` 控制 — 可单独使用或链式用于任何组件（`.instui-button.--truncate`）。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The base class uses `display: -webkit-box` and reads the `--lines` custom property to clamp text to a fixed number of lines before it ends in an ellipsis."
msgstr "基类使用 `display: -webkit-box` 并读取 `--lines` 自定义属性，以将文本限制为固定行数然后以省略号结束。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/truncate/index.ts)"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "JS Requirement"
msgstr "JS 要求"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "This component ships no CSS of its own — its markup and behavior come entirely from `@pantoken/interactions`. Its `--max-lines-auto` modifier is driven by that behavior. See the [modifier table below](#modifiers)."
msgstr "该组件自身不包含任何 CSS — 它的标记和行为完全来自 `@pantoken/interactions`。其 `--max-lines-auto` 修饰符由该行为驱动。参见下面的[修饰符表](#modifiers)。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-1`."
msgstr "`--max-lines-1` 的别名。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-2`."
msgstr "`--max-lines-2` 的别名。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-3`."
msgstr "`--max-lines-3` 的别名。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-4`."
msgstr "`--max-lines-4` 的别名。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Alias of `--max-lines-5`."
msgstr "`--max-lines-5` 的别名。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to one line (default)."
msgstr "限制为一行（默认）。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to two lines."
msgstr "限制为两行。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to three lines."
msgstr "限制为三行。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to four lines."
msgstr "限制为四行。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Clamp to five lines."
msgstr "限制为五行。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "<span class=\"instui-pill pantoken-doc-tag pantoken-doc-tag-interaction\">Interaction</span> — — Clamp to the number of lines that fit in the container, based on its height and the line height of the text."
msgstr ""

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Enables truncation and line clamping on the target element."
msgstr "在目标元素上启用截断和行数限制。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Truncate at the character level."
msgstr "（默认）按字符级别截断。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Truncate at the word level."
msgstr "按词级别截断。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Clamping relies on `-webkit-line-clamp` with `display: -webkit-box`, paired with the standard `line-clamp`."
msgstr "- 行数限制依赖于带有 `display: -webkit-box` 的 `-webkit-line-clamp`，并配合标准的 `line-clamp` 使用。"

#: css/truncate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — Body typography that this truncates."
msgstr "- [text](/api/css/text.md) — 此项截断所使用的正文排版。"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: two-column"
msgstr ""

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — Two-column layout with left and right content regions."
msgstr "`div[class~=\"instui-two-column\"]` — 两栏布局，包含左右内容区域。"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "✅ 何时使用两栏布局："

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- You have two content areas of roughly equal importance\n- Comparing or contrasting two sets of content side-by-side\n- Building a responsive layout that stacks on mobile\n🚫 Don't use Two-Column when:"
msgstr "- 你有两个重要性大致相同的内容区域\n- 需要并排比较或对照两组内容\n- 构建在移动端会垂直堆叠的响应式布局\n🚫 在以下情况下不要使用两栏布局："

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- One column dominates the page — use asymmetric layout instead\n- Content doesn't benefit from side-by-side presentation"
msgstr "- 一列主导页面 — 应改用不对称布局\n- 内容不适合并排展示"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Ensure both columns are perceivable and usable on narrow viewports\n- Use semantic landmarks (e.g., `<section>`) to wrap column content\n- Maintain sufficient space and contrast between columns"
msgstr "- 确保在窄视口上两列都可感知且可用\n- 使用语义地标（例如 `<section>`）来包裹列内容\n- 保持列间有足够的间距和对比度"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Optional visual divider between columns."
msgstr "列之间的可选视觉分隔线。"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Left column content area."
msgstr "左列内容区域。"

#: css/two-column.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Right column content area."
msgstr "右列内容区域。"

#: css/view.md
