msgstr ""

#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.-with-visual-debug` — A layout-debugging outline: compound `.-with-visual-debug` onto any element to outline the box and its immediate children, so a layout's structure is visible at a glance."
msgstr "`.-with-visual-debug` — 一个布局调试轮廓：将 `.-with-visual-debug` 复合到任何元素上，以勾勒该元素及其直接子元素的边框，从而一目了然地查看布局结构。"

#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Group:** Plugins · **Source:** [visual-debug.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/visual-debug/visual-debug.css)"
msgstr "**组：** 插件 · **来源：** [visual-debug.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/visual-debug/visual-debug.css)"

#: css/visual-debug.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The outline colour (default a bright magenta); retint it to change every debug outline."
msgstr "轮廓颜色（默认为鲜艳的品红色）；重新着色以更改所有调试轮廓。"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: wrapper"
msgstr ""

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — App-shell row: side nav, container with header, and optional panel."
msgstr "`body[class~=\"instui-display-flex\"]` — 应用外壳行：侧边导航、带页眉的容器，以及可选面板。"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "✅ Use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "✅ 何时使用 Wrapper："

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a full Canvas product page that needs a consistent layout shell\n- The page uses GlobalNav as the primary navigation anchor\n- The page needs side panels: ContentTabList, TrailingContentArea, or a UtilityPanel\n- You need consistent container padding and content max-width across the full page\n🚫 Don't use Wrapper when:"
msgstr "- 构建需要一致布局外壳的完整 Canvas 产品页面\n- 页面使用 GlobalNav 作为主要导航锚点\n- 页面需要侧面板：ContentTabList、TrailingContentArea 或 UtilityPanel\n- 需要在整个页面上保持一致的容器内边距和内容最大宽度\n🚫 不要在以下情况使用 Wrapper："

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Building a Modal, Tray, or Drawer — those have their own layout containers\n- Wrapping a sub-section of a page — Wrapper contains the full page, not a region"
msgstr "- 构建 Modal、Tray 或 Drawer —— 它们有各自的布局容器\n- 仅包裹页面的子区域 —— Wrapper 包含整个页面，而不是某个区域"

#: css/wrapper.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Map the main content area to a &lt;main&gt; landmark with a skip-nav link so keyboard users can bypass GlobalNav\n- Give ContentTabList role=\"navigation\" with a distinct aria-label such as \"Page navigation\" — separate from GlobalNav's landmark\n- Give TrailingContentArea role=\"complementary\" with a descriptive aria-label that reflects its content, such as \"Student details\"\n- Give each UtilityPanel a distinct aria-label: \"AI assistant\", \"Notifications\", or \"Filters\"\n- When a UtilityPanel opens, move focus into the panel; when it closes, return focus to the trigger that opened it"
msgstr "- 将主内容区域映射为 &lt;main&gt; 地标，并提供跳过导航链接，以便键盘用户可以绕过 GlobalNav\n- 为 ContentTabList 提供 role=\"navigation\" 并使用明确的 aria-label（例如 “Page navigation”）——与 GlobalNav 的地标区分开\n- 为 TrailingContentArea 提供 role=\"complementary\" 并使用能反映其内容的描述性 aria-label，例如 “Student details”\n- 为每个 UtilityPanel 提供不同的 aria-label：\"AI assistant\"、\"Notifications\" 或 \"Filters\"\n- 当 UtilityPanel 打开时，将焦点移动到面板内；关闭时，将焦点返回到触发它的触发器"

