msgid "It produces one variable collection with `light`/`dark` modes: colour tokens become `COLOR`\nvariables (RGBA 0–1), dimensions/numbers become `FLOAT`, everything else `STRING`. Icons are\nexcluded (they'd be Figma components, not variables). Feed [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) to a Figma\nplugin (the Variables plugin API) or the Variables REST API — the README has the plugin glue."
msgstr "它会生成一个变量集合，具有 `light`/`dark` 模式：颜色令牌会变为 `COLOR`\n变量（RGBA 0–1），尺寸/数值变为 `FLOAT`，其他则为 `STRING`。图标被排除在外（它们应该是 Figma 组件，而不是变量）。将 [toFigmaVariables](functions/toFigmaVariables.md) 提供给 Figma 插件（Variables 插件 API）或 Variables REST API — README 包含插件对接说明。"

