msgid "Swatches are a flat reduction of the tokens to named colours, delivered *directly to a designer*\nto import into their tool. This is not an interchange format (use `@pantoken/dtcg` or\n`@pantoken/figma` for that) — it's a terminal palette file: Adobe ASE, GIMP `.gpl`, or Sketch\n`.sketchpalette`."
msgstr "样本是将 token 扁平化为具名颜色的简化集合，*直接提供给设计师*\\n以便导入到他们的工具中。这不是一种交换格式（为交换请使用 `@pantoken/dtcg` 或\\n`@pantoken/figma`）— 它是终端调色板文件：Adobe ASE、GIMP `.gpl`，或 Sketch\\n`.sketchpalette`。"

