#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: initCloseButton()"
msgstr "# 函数: initCloseButton()"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wire a close button to dismiss its target."
msgstr "将关闭按钮绑定以使其能够关闭目标。"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Target resolution (first match wins):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n3. walk up to the nearest `<dialog>`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"
msgstr "Target resolution (first match wins):\n1. `data-close-target=\"id\"` — dismiss the element with that id\n2. `popovertarget` / `commandfor` — skip; native browser handles it\n3. walk up to the nearest `&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`, or `[data-dismissible]`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dismiss strategy:\n- `<dialog>` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"
msgstr "Dismiss strategy:\n- `&lt;dialog&gt;` → `dialog.close()`\n- `[popover]` → `el.hidePopover()`\n- `[data-dismissible]` or `[open]` → remove open attr + fire bubbling `close`"

#: formats/interactions/src/functions/initCloseButton.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### btn"
msgstr "### btn"

