#: packages/model/src/functions/defineToken.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build a well-formed [Token](../interfaces/Token.md) from partial input, defaulting `syntax` to `\"*\"` and\n`inherits` to `true`. Plugins import this from `@pantoken/model` to avoid depending on\n`@pantoken/core`; for smart CSS syntax inference use `defineToken` from `@pantoken/core`."
msgstr "从部分输入构建格式良好的 [Token](../interfaces/Token.md)，默认将 `syntax` 设为 `\"*\"`，并\n将 `inherits` 设为 `true`。插件从 `@pantoken/model` 导入此项以避免依赖\n`@pantoken/core`；如需智能的 CSS 语法推断，请使用来自 `@pantoken/core` 的 `defineToken`。"

#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# model"
msgstr "# model"

#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/model` — the zero-dependency type contracts for the pantoken token IR."
msgstr "`@pantoken/model` — 用于 pantoken token IR 的零依赖类型契约。"

#: packages/model/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema (`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\ninitial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and reference values,\nplus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). Icons are rolled in as `<image>` tokens.\nEvery pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer needs the\n(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."
msgstr "A [Token](interfaces/Token.md) is aligned to the CSS `@property` schema (`name`/`syntax`/`inherits`/\ninitial-`value`) and extended into a superset that also carries themed and reference values,\nplus non-value [TokenMeta](interfaces/TokenMeta.md) (icons, provenance). Icons are rolled in as `&lt;image&gt;` tokens.\nEvery pantoken package depends on this package for the type, so no consumer needs the\n(GitHub-only) upstream token package just to type the IR."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Interface: DeprecationEntry"
msgstr "# 接口: DeprecationEntry"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "One entry in the token deprecation ledger — the lifecycle of a single dropped upstream token."
msgstr "代币弃用账本中的一条条目 — 单个被弃用上游代币的生命周期。"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A shim value comes from EITHER `replacement` (emit `var(replacement)`, so theming flows through) OR\n`value` (freeze the last-known literal, when the drop has no canonical replacement). Exactly one is\nexpected; an entry with neither emits no shim."
msgstr "shim 值来自 要么 `replacement`（发出 `var(replacement)`，以便主题传递）要么\n`value`（当被弃用项没有规范替代时，冻结最后已知的字面值）。恰好应当有其中之一；若两者都没有，条目将不发出 shim。"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### token"
msgstr "### token"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The dropped upstream token name, e.g. `--instui-component-truncate-text-line-height`."
msgstr "被弃用的上游代币名称，例如 `--instui-component-truncate-text-line-height`。"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### deprecatedIn"
msgstr "### deprecatedIn"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream release that dropped it, `<tier>@<version>` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`)."
msgstr "The upstream release that dropped it, `&lt;tier&gt;@&lt;version&gt;` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.5.0\"`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### removeIn"
msgstr "### removeIn"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The upstream MINOR at which the shim is retired, `<tier>@<version>` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.6.0\"`)."
msgstr "The upstream MINOR at which the shim is retired, `&lt;tier&gt;@&lt;version&gt;` (e.g. `\"design-tokens@v1.6.0\"`)."

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### replacement?"
msgstr "### replacement?"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Forward the shim to a canonical token (emits `var(replacement)`)."
msgstr "将 shim 转发到一个规范代币（发出 `var(replacement)`）。"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### value?"
msgstr "### value?"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Freeze the shim to a literal (the token's last-known value) when there's no replacement."
msgstr "在没有替代项时，将 shim 冻结为字面值（代币的最后已知值）。"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "### note?"
msgstr "### note?"

#: packages/model/src/interfaces/DeprecationEntry.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A human note rendered in the compatibility docs and the changelog."
