msgid "# canvas-theme-editor"
msgstr "# canvas-theme-editor"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — upload-ready `theme.css`/`theme.js` for Canvas LMS's Theme\nEditor, pre-wired to pantoken's CDN-hosted CSS. Consumed by `@pantoken/scaffold`'s\n`canvas-theme-editor` platform; also usable standalone."
msgstr "`@pantoken/canvas-theme-editor` — 可上传的 `theme.css`/`theme.js`，用于 Canvas LMS 的 主题\n编辑器，已预配置为使用 pantoken 托管于 CDN 的 CSS。由 `@pantoken/scaffold` 的\n`canvas-theme-editor` 平台消费；也可独立使用。"

#: platforms/canvas-theme-editor/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` are the jsDelivr-default, unpinned output — use [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) to\ntarget a different CDN provider, pin a version, or swap in other pantoken/third-party assets."
msgstr "`THEME_CSS`/`THEME_JS` 为 jsDelivr 默认的、未固定版本的输出 — 使用 [buildTheme](functions/buildTheme.md) 来\n针对不同的 CDN 提供商、固定版本，或替换为其他 pantoken/第三方 资源。"

