msgstr "一个解析为黑色或白色的 `oklch(from …)` 表达式。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: overlayColors()"
msgstr "# 函数: overlayColors()"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Flatten `overlay` (at `percent`% strength) over an opaque `base` — a CSS-only stand-in for\nui-color-utils `overlayColors`. That helper source-over-composites two RGBA colors into one opaque\nresult; the common case (a translucent tint over a solid surface) is exactly a two-color\n`color-mix()`. General RGBA-over-RGBA compositing can't be a single CSS color, so this covers the\nopaque-base case only."
msgstr "将 `overlay`（在 `percent`% 强度下）平铺在一个不透明的 `base` 上 —— 这是对\nui-color-utils `overlayColors` 的纯 CSS 替代。该助手通过 source-over 将两个 RGBA 颜色合成为一个不透明的结果；常见情况（在实色表面上覆盖半透明色调）恰好是一个由两个颜色组成的\n`color-mix()`。一般的 RGBA 覆盖 RGBA 的合成无法表示为单一的 CSS 颜色，所以此方法仅适用于不透明底的情况。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The opaque background color."
msgstr "不透明的背景颜色。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/functions/overlayColors.md
#, no-c-format
