#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# colors"
msgstr "# colors"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-colors` — CSS-only color math that mirrors the InstUI `@instructure/ui-color-utils`\nhelpers (`alpha`, `darken`, `lighten`, `overlayColors`)."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-colors` — 仅 CSS 的颜色运算，模仿 InstUI 的 `@instructure/ui-color-utils`\n辅助函数（`alpha`、`darken`、`lighten`、`overlayColors`）。"

#: plugins/pantoken/colors/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "InstUI computes those at build time with `tinycolor2` against concrete hex values. pantoken emits\n`var(--instui-*)` references that resolve in the browser (often through `light-dark()`), so the\nmath has to happen in CSS instead. Each helper returns a CSS color string built from\n[`color-mix()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/color_value/color-mix) and\n[relative color syntax](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_colors/Relative_colors) —\nboth Baseline modern-browser features — so a single expression tracks the token even when it's a\nscheme-dependent `light-dark()` pair. Use them wherever you'd otherwise hard-code a derived shade."
msgstr "InstUI 在构建时使用 `tinycolor2` 针对具体的十六进制值进行计算。pantoken 发出\n可在浏览器中解析的 `var(--instui-*)` 引用（通常通过 `light-dark()`），因此\n这些运算必须在 CSS 中进行。每个辅助函数返回一个 CSS 颜色字符串，该字符串由\n[`color-mix()`](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/color_value/color-mix) 和\n[相对颜色语法](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/CSS/CSS_colors/Relative_colors) 构建——\n两者都是现代浏览器的基础特性——因此单个表达式可以跟踪该 token，即使它是一个\n依赖配色方案的 `light-dark()` 对。将它们用于你原本会硬编码派生色的任何地方。"

