#: plugins/pantoken/logos/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/plugin-logos` — Instructure product logos as SVGs, data URIs, and image tokens."
msgstr "`@pantoken/plugin-logos` — Instructure 产品徽标，作为 SVG、数据 URI 和图像令牌。"

#: plugins/pantoken/logos/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It vendors the SVG logos from Instructure's UX guidelines for Canvas, Mastery, Parchment,\nInstructure, LearnPlatform, and Ignite AI, in the standard layouts (horizontal, stacked, icon)\nand color modes (full-color, color, dark, reversed, and so on). Each logo is available three ways:\nthe raw SVG ([getLogoSvg](functions/getLogoSvg.md)), a data URI ([getLogoDataUri](functions/getLogoDataUri.md)), and a\n`--instui-logo-<product>-<layout>-<mode>` image token in `@pantoken/plugin-logos/logos.css`."
msgstr "It vendors the SVG logos from Instructure's UX guidelines for Canvas, Mastery, Parchment,\nInstructure, LearnPlatform, and Ignite AI, in the standard layouts (horizontal, stacked, icon)\nand color modes (full-color, color, dark, reversed, and so on). Each logo is available three ways:\nthe raw SVG ([getLogoSvg](functions/getLogoSvg.md)), a data URI ([getLogoDataUri](functions/getLogoDataUri.md)), and a\n`--instui-logo-&lt;product&gt;-&lt;layout&gt;-&lt;mode&gt;` image token in `@pantoken/plugin-logos/logos.css`."

#: plugins/pantoken/logos/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
