msgid "# Function: primitivesCss()"
msgstr "# 函数: primitivesCss()"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/functions/primitivesCss.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Build the primitive utility stylesheet. Colors get the same `bg`/`fg`/`border` shape as the semantic\ncolor utilities, but keyed on the primitive token name (`.<prefix>-bg-primitive-color-white`); font\nprimitives map to their one property via the shared token-to-class transformer. Every class only ever\npoints at a real `--instui-primitive-*` token — no arbitrary values."
msgstr "Build the primitive utility stylesheet. Colors get the same `bg`/`fg`/`border` shape as the semantic\ncolor utilities, but keyed on the primitive token name (`.&lt;prefix&gt;-bg-primitive-color-white`); font\nprimitives map to their one property via the shared token-to-class transformer. Every class only ever\npoints at a real `--instui-primitive-*` token — no arbitrary values."

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# primitives"
msgstr "# primitives"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Opt-in utility classes for the raw pantoken primitive palette (`--instui-primitive-*`)."
msgstr "为原始 pantoken 基元调色板（`--instui-primitive-*`）提供可选择的实用类。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The semantic utilities in `@pantoken/components` deliberately expose only semantic tokens — a color\noverride there is always a role (`bg-brand`), never a raw swatch. This package is the escape hatch:\none class per primitive token for the rare case a developer needs the palette directly. Load it on\nits own (`@pantoken/plugin-primitives/primitives.css`), separate from the semantic layer."
msgstr "`@pantoken/components` 中的语义实用工具有意只暴露语义令牌——在那里颜色\n覆盖总是一个角色（`bg-brand`），而不是原始色板。此包是逃生通道：\n每个基元令牌对应一个类，以应对开发者在罕见情况下需要直接使用调色板的需求。将其单独\n加载（`@pantoken/plugin-primitives/primitives.css`），与语义层分离。"

#: plugins/pantoken/primitives/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Build the primitive stylesheet**"
msgstr "**构建基元样式表**"

