msgstr "TypeDoc 应用程序。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: rewriteComment()"
msgstr "# 函数: rewriteComment()"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/functions/rewriteComment.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Move every `@demo` block tag on a comment into `demo` fences appended to its summary, in order.\nBlock-tag content gets re-fenced by the markdown theme, so the fence must live in the summary\nprose, which is emitted verbatim."
msgstr "将注释中每个 `@demo` 块标签按顺序移入附加到其摘要的 `demo` 围栏中。\n块标签内容会被 Markdown 主题重新加围栏，所以围栏必须位于摘要\n正文中，该正文按原样输出。"

