#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# demo"
msgstr "# demo"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` — a TypeDoc plugin for the `@demo` block tag."
msgstr "`@pantoken/typedoc-plugin-demo` — 用于 `@demo` 块标签的 TypeDoc 插件。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Authors attach a live, embeddable demo to any symbol with `@demo <spec>`, where `<spec>` is either\na bare URL or a `<provider>:<ref>` pair (for example `stackblitz:abc123`, `codesandbox:xy12z`,\n`wp-playground:https://…/blueprint.json`, or `self:button`). This plugin registers nothing about\nproviders itself — it stays deliberately dumb and reusable: it moves each `@demo` tag's spec into\na fenced `demo` block appended to the symbol's summary, and your docs renderer decides how to\nturn a spec into an iframe. (See `@pantoken/demo` for a renderer that resolves the providers.)"
msgstr "Authors attach a live, embeddable demo to any symbol with `@demo &lt;spec&gt;`, where `&lt;spec&gt;` is either\na bare URL or a `&lt;provider&gt;:&lt;ref&gt;` pair (for example `stackblitz:abc123`, `codesandbox:xy12z`,\n`wp-playground:https://…/blueprint.json`, or `self:button`). This plugin registers nothing about\nproviders itself — it stays deliberately dumb and reusable: it moves each `@demo` tag's spec into\na fenced `demo` block appended to the symbol's summary, and your docs renderer decides how to\nturn a spec into an iframe. (See `@pantoken/demo` for a renderer that resolves the providers.)"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The fence rides through markdown untouched — including any translation pipeline that preserves\ncode blocks — so the demo survives localization."
msgstr "该代码围栏在 markdown 中原样保留——包括任何保留\ncode blocks 的翻译流程——因此演示可在本地化后仍然存活。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Setup:** add `\"@demo\"` to TypeDoc's `blockTags` option. The comment parser reads that list before\nplugins load, so a plugin can't register the tag late enough to suppress the \"unknown block tag\"\nwarning; it must be in your `typedoc.json`."
msgstr "**Setup:** 将 `\"@demo\"` 添加到 TypeDoc 的 `blockTags` 选项。注释解析器在该列表被读取时位于\n插件加载之前，所以插件无法在足够晚的时候注册该标签以消除 \"未知块标签\"\n警告；它必须位于你的 `typedoc.json` 中。"

#: plugins/typedoc/demo/src/variables/DEMO_FENCE.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
