msgstr "此插件使用的块标签。将其在 TypeDoc 的 `blockTags` 中注册，以便不会出现警告。"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/functions/matchesFilters.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Function: matchesFilters()"
msgstr "# 函数: matchesFilters()"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/functions/matchesFilters.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Returns `true` if the changed filename passes the node's include/ignore filters."
msgstr "如果更改的文件名通过该节点的 include/ignore 过滤器，则返回 `true`。"

