msgstr "### outputWatchPaths?"

#: plugins/vite/workspace-orchestrator/src/interfaces/OrchestratorOptions.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Paths to watch with native `fs.watch` so Vite picks up built output after an upstream rebuild\n(e.g. a package's `dist` or `generated` directory). Uses native `fs.watch` rather than\nchokidar's `add()`, which doesn't reliably detect changes in pnpm-symlinked or out-of-root\ndirectories. On each change a synthetic `\"change\"` event is emitted on `server.watcher`: for\nCSS files already in the module graph Vite triggers a targeted hot-update; for anything else\nit falls back to a full page reload."
msgstr "使用原生 `fs.watch` 监听的路径，以便在上游重建后 Vite 能拾取构建产物\n（例如某个包的 `dist` 或 `generated` 目录）。使用原生 `fs.watch` 而不是\nchokidar 的 `add()`，后者无法可靠检测 pnpm 符号链接或根目录外目录中的更改。每次更改时会在 `server.watcher` 上触发一个合成的 `\"change\"` 事件：对于\n已在模块图中的 CSS 文件，Vite 会触发有针对性的热更新；对其他任何内容则回退到完整页面刷新。"

