#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# pendo"
msgstr "# pendo"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/pendo` — an Instructure-styled global stylesheet for Pendo guides."
msgstr "`@pantoken/pendo` — 用于 Pendo 指南的 Instructure 风格全局样式表。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Pendo injects guide HTML into a host page; this renders that guide DOM (`._pendo-*`) to match\nInstructure UI, using pantoken's `--instui-*` token layer for alignment. It includes responsive\nviolet and sea banner guide treatments alongside alerts, popovers, surveys, and controls. The\ncomponent CSS is ported from `@instructure/pendo-global-css`; pantoken supplies the tokens and the\nassembly. A single theme class containing `instui` activates the scoped stylesheet; compact\nsuffixes on that class select banner colors and glyphs."
msgstr "Pendo 将指南 HTML 注入宿主页面；此组件将该指南 DOM (`._pendo-*`) 渲染为符合 Instructure UI 的样式，使用 pantoken 的 `--instui-*` 令牌层进行对齐。它包含响应式的紫色和海色横幅指南样式，以及告警、弹出框、调查和控件。组件 CSS 来源于 `@instructure/pendo-global-css`；pantoken 提供令牌与组装。包含 `instui` 的单一主题类会激活作用域样式表；该类上的紧凑后缀用于选择横幅颜色和图标。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) composes the stylesheet; [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) is the ready-made `rebrand` build\n(scoped, `!important`). A static file is published at `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`."
msgstr "[buildPendoCss](functions/buildPendoCss.md) 负责组合样式表；[pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md) 是已准备好的 `rebrand` 构建\n（已作用域，`!important`）。一个静态文件发布于 `@pantoken/pendo/global.css`。"

#: renderers/pendo/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"
msgstr "重命名并重新导出 [pendoCss](variables/pendoCss.md)"

