msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A rehype plugin that tags GitHub-alert blockquotes: it detects a `[!NOTE]`-style marker at the\nstart of a blockquote, records it as `data-alert=\"note\"`, and strips the marker text. The React\n`blockquote` component then renders an InstUI `Alert`."
msgstr "一个 rehype 插件，用于标记 GitHub 警示引用块：它在引用块的\n开头检测到一个 `[!NOTE]` 风格的标记，将其记录为 `data-alert=\"note\"`，并去除该标记文本。React\n`blockquote` 组件随后渲染一个 InstUI `Alert`。"

