#: renderers/web-components/src/functions/isolate.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Wrap `value` in Unicode bidi isolates (FSI/PDI) so it doesn't scramble the surrounding text's\ndirection — e.g. a Latin filename embedded in an Arabic sentence built with plain string\nconcatenation. `formatMessage` already does this for MF2 placeholders; use `isolate` only when\ninterpolating outside MF2."
msgstr "将 `value` 包裹在 Unicode 双向文本隔离符（FSI/PDI）中，以免扰乱周围文本的方向 — 例如在使用普通字符串\n拼接构建的阿拉伯语句子中嵌入的拉丁文件名。`formatMessage` 已经为 MF2 占位符做了此处理；仅在\nMF2 之外进行插值时才使用 `isolate`。"

