#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# Variable: button"
msgstr "# 变量: button"

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-button>` — a token-styled `<button>`. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-<variant>`\nmodifier (`secondary`, `tertiary`, `success`, `danger`, `ai`, …); `margin` adds spacing around the\nhost (InstUI keywords like `small` / `medium large`); slotted content is the label."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-button&gt;` — a token-styled `&lt;button&gt;`. The `variant` attribute maps to the `-color-&lt;variant&gt;`\nmodifier (`secondary`, `tertiary`, `success`, `danger`, `ai`, …); `margin` adds spacing around the\nhost (InstUI keywords like `small` / `medium large`); slotted content is the label."

#: renderers/web-components/src/variables/button.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional `popovertargetaction`) toggles any\nlight-DOM `[popover]` such as `<instui-context-view>`, `<instui-popover>`, or `<instui-tray>`, and\n`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`<instui-modal>` with `--show`/`--close`,\netc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it resolves across the shadow\nboundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."
msgstr "It is also a native invoker: `popovertarget` (with optional `popovertargetaction`) toggles any\nlight-DOM `[popover]` such as `&lt;instui-context-view&gt;`, `&lt;instui-popover&gt;`, or `&lt;instui-tray&gt;`, and\n`command`/`commandfor` drives the command-based components (`&lt;instui-modal&gt;` with `--show`/`--close`,\netc.). The id is forwarded to the inner button via the invoker IDL, so it resolves across the shadow\nboundary and may point forward to an element declared later in the document."

