msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`<instui-tray>` — a panel docked to a viewport edge, backed by a native `[popover]` (top layer +\nlight-dismiss). `placement` maps to `-placement-<value>` (e.g. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) and\n`size` to `-size-<value>`; a light-DOM `popovertarget` button toggles it by id. Content goes in the\ndefault slot."
msgstr "`&lt;instui-tray&gt;` — a panel docked to a viewport edge, backed by a native `[popover]` (top layer +\nlight-dismiss). `placement` maps to `-placement-&lt;value&gt;` (e.g. `start`, `end`, `top`, `bottom`) and\n`size` to `-size-&lt;value&gt;`; a light-DOM `popovertarget` button toggles it by id. Content goes in the\ndefault slot."

