msgstr "When set, appends a live preview after each `html` fence on matching pages — the same markup,\nrendered live, beneath its source. Overlay examples (`&lt;dialog&gt;`, `[popover]`) are skipped: they're\nhidden until opened, so a `## Demo` iframe drives their preview instead."

